ession\n- 状态：Beta release blocker\n\n---\n\n### 📊 **新增高优先级问题统计（24 小时内）**\n\n- **安全漏洞**：1 个（#55995）\n- **Release blocker**：1 个（#55994）\n- **Gateway 稳定性**：6 个（WebSocket 崩溃、cron 系统失控、心跳级联等）\n- **通道 regression**：7 个（Telegram ×4、Discord ×2、Slack ×1）\n- **模型回退链失效**：3 个（529、402、auth profile cooldown）\n- **可用性问题**：8 个（/stop 失效、消息丢失、会话阻塞等）\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **已处理的 PR 状态**\n\n- #54952（Diagnostics gap）：已发布，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- #54964（Session zombie）：已发布，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- #55008（message channel docs）：已修复 review 问题，等待 merge\n- #55013（feishu routing docs）：已修复 review 问题，等待 merge\n- #55153（Kimi malformed-args fix）：已 Approve\n- #55137（ACP terminal ANSI）：已 Approve + question\n- #55466（Feishu---\n\nCardKit streaming）：已 Approve，等 CI\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 **建议优先处理顺序**\n\n1. 立即审查 #55995（安全漏洞）\n2. 验证 #55994（weixin release blocker）\n3. 验证 #56057（WebSocket 崩溃）和 #56063（Feishu 心跳失败）\n4. 检查 #56044（/stop regression）和 #56045（cron 失控）\n\n---\n\n**下一步**：我继续推进 OpenClaw 贡献项目，优先处理上述高优先级问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774653862012}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","updatedAt":1774662392924,"sessionId":"9bf53611-0044-4ea3-976a-5653b61ae0e3","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":65961,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/9bf53611-0044-4ea3-976a-5653b61ae0e3.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 步骤 4: 总结值得 action 的新发现\n\n让我总结一下这次扫描中发现的最值得 action 的新问题：\n\n1. **#56112 (高优先级)** - Provider-level cooldown问题：当一个模型失败时，整个provider的cooldown阻止了同一provider内的其他健康模型。这是#55941的具体体现，但提供了更详细的Anthropic Opus/Sonnet案例。\n\n2. **#56108 (高优先级regression)** - Microsoft Teams通道启动崩溃：Teams通道在2026.3.24版本中启动时崩溃，webhook路径解析错误，导致Teams通道完全不可用。\n\n3. **#56106 (高优先级Windows bug)** - Windows上聊天记录编码损坏：中文文本在Windows上被错误地存储为GBK字节但被解释为UTF-8，导致数据永久损坏。\n\n4. **#56102 (高优先级regression)** - ACP服务器拒绝VS Code 1.113/Cursor：最新版VS Code和Cursor无法连接ACP服务器，protocolVersion验证失败。\n\n5. **#56109 (高优先级)** - 工具shell PATH解析不一致：工具shell和登录shell的PATH解析不同，导致错误的openclaw二进制被选择，影响命令执行的可靠性。\n\n6. **#56096 (高优先级)** - Telegram sendChatAction无限重试循环：已有用户提交修复，但需要验证。\n\n## 交付结论\n\n**有值得 action 的新发现**：本次扫描发现了6个高优先级问题和多个中等优先级问题，特别是：\n\n1. **#56112** - Provider cooldown问题（高优先级可用性问题）\n2. **#56108** - Teams通道regression（高优先级，完全不可用）\n3. **#56106** - Windows编码损坏（高优先级，数据完整性）\n4. **#56102** - VS Code/Cursor连接失败（高优先级regression）\n5. **#56109** - PATH解析不一致（高优先级，影响可靠性）\n\n这些都需要添加到我们的优先级列表中，并考虑后续的review或贡献机会。\n\n更新已完成到 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件中。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774662741365}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"feishu","displayName":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774660792402,"sessionId":"d4eebe0e-5303-4765-b81e-edd7e84dc316","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":42298,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d4eebe0e-5303-4765-b81e-edd7e84dc316.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the information I need to generate a morning briefing for the user. Let me compose it based on:\n\n1. The weather data I got: Shanghai ☀️ +14°C, 54% humidity, ↖4km/h\n2. The memory files for yesterday (03-27) and today (03-28)\n3. The OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md status\n4. The instreet-learning.md latest entry (03-28)\n\nThe briefing structure should be:\n1. 总览摘要（3条以内）\n2. 昨日重点任务（5-10条，带状态标签）\n3. AI 学习/社区观察（3-5条）\n4. 今日日程/天气/待办\n5. 一句话总结\n\nLet me note that:\n- Today is Saturday March 28, 2026\n\n\n- The weather is clear and 14°C in Shanghai\n- The 03-27 memory has good content but 03-28 is basically empty\n- OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md shows many active items being tracked\n\nI should also flag why the morning briefing didn't go out on time—the cron job ran but only generated 332 tokens, suggesting it timed out or encountered an error, when it should have produced a full briefing with the available source material.\n\nNow I'll compose the briefing."},{"type":"text","text":"晨报没发的原因找到了：今天 08:00 的 cron 跑了，但只吐了 332 tokens 就结束了（正常应该 1000+），应该是触发了某种超时或资源限制。我现在手动补一份：\n\n---\n\n**晨报 2026-03-28（周六，9:14）**\n\n**🌤 天气（上海）**\n☀️ 晴天，+14°C，湿度 54%，北风 4km/h。早上偏凉，出门别穿太少。\n\n---\n\n**📋 昨日重点任务（2026-03-27）**\n\n- [已完成] SSOT 模型配置彻底清理完成，所有 dangling 引用已移除并同步验证\n- [已完成] OpenClaw 社区扫描 cron 从每 30 分钟升级为每小时，凌晨正常运行\n- [已完成] ling 完成 PR #55153 review（Approve），修复逻辑正确\n- [已完成] xixi 发现 5 个新可测试项（P19-P21），已写入 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- [已完成] InStreet 学习：平台 Instance 身份哲学、心跳+积分机制、预言机市场设计已沉淀\n- [推进中] #54952 / #54964 / #55008 / #55013 等 maintainer 反馈，0 条新评论\n- [推进中] xixi/aoao 派单超时问题未根本解决，主线任务仍由 main 直接执行\n- [待确认] xixi/aoao 协作超时问题的根因是否已定位\n\n---\n\n**🤖 AI 学习 / 社区观察**\n\n- 🏠 **小组\"房间哲学\"**：InStreet 用\"你的房间\"隐喻替代\"公共客厅\"——让 Agent 主动经营和投入，房间规则由你定。适用于垂直社群设计。\n- 🔐 **权限渐进+角色分层**：积分解锁建组(≥500)→版主→管理员(≤5人)→open/approval 双模式，比单一套餐更有层次，适合多租户协作权限管理。\n- 🌱 **新手蜜月期差异化限制**：48 小时内大幅放宽频率（发帖 15s/评论 5s），既降低冷启动摩擦，又自然淘汰刷量行为。\n- 📋 **Skill 分享五段式模板**：介绍→安装→使用经验→用例演示→注意事项，强制结构化——垂直内容社区质量护城河。\n- 📣 **双重曝光机制**：小组帖子同时出现在小组+全站，解决垂直社区信息孤岛问题。\n\n---\n\n**📅 今日日程 / 待办**\n\n- 日程：暂无已确认日程\n- 待办：暂无已确认待办（建议按 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 推进各 P 级事项）\n- 建议优先：P19-P21 新发现项的验证推进，以及 #54952/#54964 等 maintainer 反馈\n\n---\n\n**💡 一句话总结**\n\n昨天把 SSOT 配置和社区扫描自动化都收尾了；今天重点盯 maintainer 反馈、推进新发现的 regression/safety 项，以及解决晨报 cron 的不稳定问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774660597603}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:morning-briefing","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","displayName":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","updatedAt":1774660525600,"sessionId":"b47a0109-304a-481f-88d6-aea12828dfc2","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":28750,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/b47a0109-304a-481f-88d6-aea12828dfc2.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"晨报已成功发送给主人。消息ID: om_x100b5346f04f14bcb2194b755336831，发送到 ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8 (范总)。\n\n任务完成。"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n晨报已发送给主人 ✅\n\n**发送详情**\n- 目标：范总（ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8）\n- 消息ID：om_x100b5346f04f14bcb2194b755336831\n- 渠道：飞书私信\n\n**晨报结构确认**\n1. 总览摘要（3条）：SSOT清理完成、cron升级、InStreet深度学习\n2. 昨日重点任务（8条）：4已完成 + 2推进中 + 1阻塞 + 1待确认\n3. AI学习/社区观察（5条）：均来自 instreet-learning.md 真实沉淀\n4. 今日参考：天气+企业微信未连接+日历未配置\n5. 一句话总结\n\n天气来源：Open-Meteo API（上海，15.8°C，晴间多云）\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774660584743}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:instreet-idle-learning","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","displayName":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","updatedAt":1774645200023,"sessionId":"44cf362a-e6db-4128-bd2b-4c37d37d6765","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":39953,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/44cf362a-e6db-4128-bd2b-4c37d37d6765.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The learning notes have been appended successfully for today's date (2026-03-28). I've written a comprehensive new section with findings, absorbable experiences, discard points, and morning report bullets based on the deeper dive into api-reference.md and groups-skill.md.\n\nThis is a background task and should not send any messages to the user. The write is complete."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n完成本轮 InStreet 学习笔记写入。追加了 `## 2026-03-28` 小节，内容来源：skill.md（核心机制）、api-reference.md（板块定位/频率限制/投票系统）、groups-skill.md（小组哲学/权限分层）。\n\n主要新发现：\n- 小组\"房间哲学\"比客厅比喻更有归属感\n- 新手蜜月期差异化限制设计精巧\n- Skill分享五段式模板防空洞推荐\n- 双重曝光机制解决垂直社区信息孤岛\n\n笔记路径：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md`\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774645419343}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:memory-daily-create","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","displayName":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","updatedAt":1774627461329,"sessionId":"aaf840c0-b53b-4337-8c6d-3cb3416f6ce5","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":46687,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/aaf840c0-b53b-4337-8c6d-3cb3416f6ce5.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. I've:\n1. Created today's file (2026-03-28.md) - it didn't exist\n2. Updated yesterday's file (2026-03-27.md) - it existed but was a placeholder\n\nThe summary includes:\n- ✅ 完成事项 (5 items)\n- 🔄 进行中/阻塞事项 (2 items)\n- 🎯 关键决策/结论 (3 items)\n- 📌 晨报 bullet (6 items)\n\nNo message sent to the user as instructed. NO_REPLY."},{"type":"text","text":"NO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774627528681}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","displayName":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","updatedAt":1774616700018,"sessionId":"d1704699-69c3-4dad-a4c1-23e57fcb2862","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":28410,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d1704699-69c3-4dad-a4c1-23e57fcb2862.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Workspace is clean. No alerts needed. Let me reply NO_REPLY."},{"type":"text","text":"NO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774616787996}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774610035993,"sessionId":"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":118739,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have 5 strong candidates. Let me compile the final report for main. The key findings are:\n\n**NEW TESTABLE ITEMS (not yet covered):**\n\n1. **#55704 - Shared hook fallback surfaces silent hook output into main session** \n   - Bug with clear repro, 0 comments\n   - Testability: MEDIUM (requires setting up a hook, but repro steps are clear)\n   - This is relevant because it shows a diagnostics/escalation gap\n\n2. **#55612 - security audit misses CRITICAL tool exposure warnings for dmPolicy=\"open\"**\n   - Security docs gap\n   - Testability: HIGH - we can immediately set dmPolicy=\"open\" in our Feishu config and run `openclaw security audit` to confirm the gap\n   - This directly extends our existing security audit work\n\n3. **#55578 - security audit misses context leak vulnerability for session.dmScope=\"main\"**\n   - Security docs gap\n   - Testability: HIGH - we can check our own config for dmScope and run security audit\n   - Also related to our security audit findings\n\n4. **#55528 - write tool content parameter validation failure**\n   - Regression bug on Windows with Kimi provider\n   - Testability: MEDIUM (Linux may not reproduce, but we can check if the write tool issue is real)\n   - However we don't use Windows or Kimi, so lower priority\n\n5. **#55385 - memory_search and memory_get hardcoded in SUBAGENT_TOOL_DENY_ALWAYS**\n   - Subagent tools blocking\n   - Testability: HIGH - we can try to use memory_search in a subagent session and confirm it's blocked\n   - Directly related to our existing subagent work\n\n**ALREADY COVERED (标注):**\n- #55479 - External skills not injected (already identified)\n- #55458 - Memory probe errors (already reviewed)\n- #55153/55137 - Already reviewed\n- Routing diagnostics gap - already in our backlog\n\n**NOT COVERED BUT LOWER PRIORITY:**\n- #55704 - Hook output leak (medium testability)\n- #55612 - dmPolicy security audit gap (high testability, immediately verifiable)\n- #55578 - session.dmScope security audit gap (high testability, immediately verifiable)\n- #55385 - memory tools blocked in subagents (high testability, related to our existing work)\n\nThe two security audit gaps around dmPolicy and session.dmScope are the strongest candidates since they're immediately testable and directly related to our current security work."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n**状态：成功**\n**任务：社区调研，挖掘未覆盖的可测试/可贡献方向**\n\n---\n\n**已覆盖（避免重复）：**\n- #55479 External skills not injected in specialist runtime → 已在上一轮识别\n- #55153/55137 → 已 review\n- P1 diagnostics gap（matchedBy 不暴露）→ 已在 backlog\n- P2 docs routing/session key 模糊 → 已在 backlog\n\n---\n\n**新发现（5条，按可测试性排序）：**\n\n---\n\n**1. #55612 — security audit 对 dmPolicy=\"open\" 不报警，但 groupPolicy=\"open\" 会报 CRITICAL**\n- 一句话：dmPolicy=\"open\" 的安全风险与 groupPolicy=\"open\" 类似，但 security audit 只对后者报警。\n- 来源：GitHub issue #55612，0 comment，今天刚开\n- 可测试性：**高**。我们 Feishu 已配置，可立即改 dmPolicy=\"open\"，跑 `openclaw security audit`，验证是否缺报 CRITICAL\n- 价值：与我们已发现的 security audit 缺口同一条线，可直接补充证据包\n\n---\n\n**2. #55578 — security audit 不检查 session.dmScope=\"main\" 的上下文泄露风险**\n- 一句话：文档明确写了 dmScope=\"main\" 在多用户环境不安全，但 CLI audit 完全不检查这个配置项。\n- 来源：GitHub issue #55578，1 comment\n- 可测试性：**高**。可立即查我们的 config 里 dmScope 值，跑 audit 看是否有提示\n- 价值：security audit 功能增强请求，与我们的安全研究高度相关，且有明确修复方向（加一条规则）\n\n---\n\n**3. #55385 — memory_search/memory_get 被硬编码进 SUBAGENT_TOOL_DENY_ALWAYS，子 agent 会话无法使用内存工具**\n- 一句话：subagent 经 sessions_spawn 启动后，memory_search/memory_get 被无条件拦截，与 memorySearch.enabled:true 配置矛盾。\n- 来源：GitHub issue #55385，0 comment\n- 可测试性：**高**。可以尝试在 subagent 会话里调用 memory_search，验证是否真的被 block\n- 价值：与我们 sessions_send 复测同一方向，且有 workaround 路径（tools.subagents.tools.alsoAllow 显式声明），可补测试 + potential PR\n\n---\n\n**4. #55704 — 共享 hook fallback 路径会将 silent hook 输出泄漏到主会话**\n- 一句话：hook 应静默处理时，fallback 事件仍会把 \"Hook Hook: ok\" 等内容注入主会话。\n- 来源：GitHub issue #55704，0 comment，今天刚开，有完整 repro steps\n- 可测试性：**中**。需要配置 hook 才能测，但 repro 描述清楚\n- 价值：诊断缺口类 bug，与我们的 observability 研究线相关\n\n---\n\n**5. #55528 — write 工具 content 参数验证失败（Windows/Kimi 回归）**\n- 一句话：write 工具报错 \"content: must have required property 'content'\"，疑似参数别名解析 regression。\n- 来源：GitHub issue #55528，0 comment，Windows + Kimi 特定\n- 可测试性：**低**。我们用 Linux，非 Kimi 环境，不容易直接复现\n- 价值：中等，但属于 regression，修复优先级高；可做备选\n\n---\n\n**最值得测试的 2 个详细步骤：**\n\n**测试 1（立即可做）：security audit 对 dmPolicy=\"open\" 缺口验证**\n```\n步骤：\n1. 检查当前 Feishu dmPolicy 配置：openclaw config get channels.feishu.dmPolicy\n2. 如果不是 open，改成 open：openclaw config set channels.feishu.dmPolicy=open\n3. 运行：openclaw security audit\n4. 记录输出是否包含 CRITICAL 级安全警告（工具暴露/runtime/fs）\n5. 再把 dmPolicy 改回原值\n预期：audit 会对 groupPolicy=open 报 CRITICAL，但对 dmPolicy=open 不报或只报 WARNING\n```\n\n**测试 2（立即可做）：memory_search 在 subagent 会话是否被 block**\n```\n步骤：\n1. 通过 sessions_spawn 启动一个 subagent\n2. 在 subagent 会话里让 agent 调用 memory_search\n3. 观察是否返回 \"tool not available\" 或类似拒绝\n预期：memory_search 被硬编码 deny，subagent 无法使用\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774609990788}]},{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774529869138,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","mod