hatGPT-Codex x1）：一致指出 groupPolicy 是访问控制参数而非 agent 选择参数，文档描述有误"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774520391721}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:59434d74-31e7-45c5-98bc-db917fcc79dd","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目状态检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目状态检查","updatedAt":1774520086242,"sessionId":"8c772f4a-e8ec-4cdb-90b7-559d799e9548","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/8c772f4a-e8ec-4cdb-90b7-559d799e9548.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起来 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件不存在。让我先检查 memory 目录是否存在，然后创建项目状态文件。\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_z60yuxxrv1bnqqyvdacjnott","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la memory/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774520285707}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:f957cfab-2639-496f-ae42-abdf9ecdc18f","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每 30 分钟推进检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每 30 分钟推进检查","updatedAt":1774519359936,"sessionId":"74365216-ffde-4a40-9575-6a2f31029a78","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/74365216-ffde-4a40-9575-6a2f31029a78.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774519965291,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted."}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"feishu:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","updatedAt":1774506631356,"sessionId":"a68614d5-9196-482f-b1b3-e88896055820","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a68614d5-9196-482f-b1b3-e88896055820.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 🚨 OpenClaw 项目大量新发现（2026-03-28 00:31）\n\n### 高优先级 Regression（P10, P12, P13, P17, P19）\n\n**#55816 pi-* 0.63.0 升级 regression**\n- 问题：升级后自定义 provider 失败，报错 \"No API key for provider\"\n- 根因：streamFn 被替换后 API key 解析丢失\n- 优先级：高，能本地验证，已有明确修复方案\n\n**#55844 Channels not initializing on gateway startup**\n- 现象：channels: {} in health\n- 优先级：高优先级 regression\n\n**#55842 Gateway crash loop — RegExpCompiler OOM**\n- 版本：v2026.3.13 → v2026.3.24 升级路径\n- 根因：RegExpCompiler OOM\n- 优先级：高优先级 regression\n\n**#55817 Beta 2 broken (ENOENT /app)**\n- 现象：auto-upgrade 触发\n- 优先级：regression，有 bug 标签\n\n**#55873 Discord health-monitor restart crash (maxAttempts=0)**\n- 现象：health-monitor 重启后 gateway 立即 crash\n- 优先级：高优先级 regression\n\n### 阻塞性 Bug（P21）\n\n**#55863 plugins.entries rejects configSchema fields**\n- 影响：阻塞性 bug，影响所有需要运行时配置的插件（如 memory-qdrant）\n\n### 行为 Bug（P18）\n\n**#55805 plugins install npm fallback fails**\n- 问题：clawhub 失败后未 fallback 到 npm\n\n### 可用性问题（P11, P14, P16, P20）\n\n**#55808 WhatsApp echo loop bug**\n- 现象：selfChatMode: true 时仍回音\n- 已有 workaround：用单独号码\n\n**#55834 Model fallback fails when cooldown**\n- 问题：cooldown 导致 fallback 失败\n\n**#55825 webchat 显示内部 memory 上下文**\n- 问题：memory 片段泄露到 UI\n- 影响：隐私/可用性问题\n\n**#55862 Gateway stuck in retry loop after provider outage**\n- 问题：provider 恢复后仍需手动重启 gateway\n- 影响：无自恢复能力\n\n### 资源泄漏（P15）\n\n**#55829 exec tool orphaned grep processes**\n- 问题：管道子进程不被回收\n- 影响：资源泄漏\n\n### 当前优先级概览\n| 类型 | 数量 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 高优先级 regression | 5 | #55816, #55844, #55842, #55813, #55873 |\n| 阻塞性 bug | 1 | #55863 |\n| 行为 bug | 1 | #55805 |\n| 可用性问题 | 4 | #55808, #55834, #55825, #55862 |\n| 资源泄漏 | 1 | #55829 |\n\n**建议**：优先修复高优先级 regression 和阻塞性 bug。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774629309576},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 🚨 OpenClaw 项目更多新发现（2026-03-28 03:31）\n\n### 高优先级 Regression/Bug/路由/隐私/UX问题（6 项）\n\n**#55889 AI agent empty {} after extended session**\n- 问题：长时间会话后工具调用发送空 {} 而不是 {\"command\": \"...\"}\n- 影响：高优先级 regression，长时间会话后工具调用失败\n\n**#55942 NVIDIA NIM Kimi 2.5 broken in OpenClaw > 2026.2.25**\n- 影响：高优先级 regression，影响 NVIDIA NIM 用户\n- 范围：明确版本范围\n\n**#55976 message tool schema: buttons regression**\n- 问题：buttons 被错误标记为所有 action 的 required\n- 状态：高优先级 regression，schema 验证问题\n\n**#55964 Telegram tool execution fails on 2026.3.24**\n- 影响：高优先级 bug，Telegram 工具执行完全失败\n\n**#55931 subagent wrong sourceChannel routing**\n- 问题：sessions_spawn 创建子代理时 sourceChannel = \"web\" 而不是原始消息 channel\n- 影响：高优先级路由问题，影响多频道部署\n\n**#55981 multi-agent announce step posts wrong chat**\n- 问题：sessions_send announce step 发到错误 chat\n- 影响：高优先级隐私/UX 问题，多代理架构中消息路由错误\n\n### 高优先级可用性问题（4 项）\n\n**#55938 Browser relay 502 issue**\n- 问题：browser status is running=true 时仍返回 502\n- 影响：高优先级可用性问题，影响 macOS 用户\n\n**#55941 Auth profile cooldown blocks model fallback**\n- 问题：Sonnet 被 Opus rate limit 阻塞\n- 影响：高优先级可用性问题，模型回退链失效\n\n**#55930 Empty Parameter Tool Calling Failure**\n- 影响：高优先级可用性问题，Agent 反复使用空参数调用工具\n\n**#55919 Anthropic 429 misclassified**\n- 问题：被误分类为 transient rate limit 而不是 \"Extra usage required for long context\"\n- 影响：高优先级可用性问题，用户得到错误建议\n\n### 中等优先级 Bug/可用性问题（5 项）\n\n**#55929 session-memory hook loading issue**\n- 问题：hooks.internal.enabled defaults to undefined\n- 影响：内置 hook 加载问题\n\n**#55969 Image tool error**\n- 问题：No media-understanding provider registered for openrouter\n- 影响：中等优先级可用性问题，图像分析功能失败\n\n**#55966 Telegram ENOSPC crash**\n- 问题：磁盘空间不足处理不当，留下零字节语音文件\n- 影响：中等优先级 bug，后续转录时 EOF crash\n\n**#55963 session-memory hook timezone issue**\n- 问题：UTC date in filename + subagent_ended not handled\n- 影响：中等优先级 bug，时区和子代理事件处理\n\n**#55956 Voice Call Plugin Telnyx mapping wrong**\n- 问题：Telnyx 转录字段映射错误\n- 影响：中等优先级 bug\n\n### CLI/配置/功能问题（3 项）\n\n**#55907 CLI config set bug**\n- 问题：`openclaw config set` 将负数键用额外引号包裹\n- 影响：CLI bug，影响 Telegram supergroup ID 配置\n\n**#55943 subagent sessions don't trigger session-memory hook**\n- 影响：功能缺失，子代理记忆文件不生成\n\n**#55954 Feature: agent-optimized CLI mode**\n- 影响：低优先级功能请求\n\n### 安全/可用性/配置问题（3 项）\n\n**#55887 Discord before_dispatch hook bypasses requireMention**\n- 问题：hook 绕过 mention 要求检查\n- 影响：安全/权限问题\n\n**#55900 web_fetch SSRF issue**\n- 问题：代理使用 RFC 2544 fake-IP 时被 SSRF 阻塞\n- 影响：可用性问题，代理场景\n\n**#55890 autoThreadName config schema issue**\n- 问题：autoThreadName 配置在 release notes 中但不被识别\n- 影响：配置 schema 问题\n\n### 统计\n| 类型 | 新增 | 总计 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 高优先级 regression/bug/路由/隐私/UX | 6 | #55889, #55942, #55976, #55964, #55931, #55981 |\n| 高优先级可用性问题 | 4 | #55938, #55941, #55930, #55919 |\n| 中等优先级 bug/可用性 | 5 | #55929, #55969, #55966, #55963, #55956 |\n| CLI/配置/功能问题 | 3 | #55907, #55943, #55954 |\n| 安全/可用性/配置问题 | 3 | #55887, #55900, #55890 |\n\n**新增总数：22 项（从 P22 到 P43）**"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774639997128}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:de883cd9-8125-48f5-b87b-9ea99b0548a9","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每日推进检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每日推进检查","updatedAt":1774492200361,"sessionId":"4a55bcc3-17f3-4dd1-a777-3c76345b10ae","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":30149,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/4a55bcc3-17f3-4dd1-a777-3c76345b10ae.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起来xixi和aoao的会话都在，但可能处于非活跃状态。让我检查工作区中是否有可以直接推进的明确动作。基于我读取的信息，现在总结检查结果：\n\n根据我的检查，当前状态如下：\n\n**[待拍板]**\n1. P1 diagnostics gap issue草稿已准备就绪，但需要最终确认是否已补齐所有证据字段并可直接发布\n2. P2 docs PR最小补丁大纲已定，但需要决定是否等待P1 issue反馈后再提交\n\n**[进展]**\n1. 项目方向已稳定收敛：从\"疑似bug\"转为\"diagnostics/observability gap\"框架，提高issue成功率\n2. 已产出可直接贴GitHub的英文issue草稿v2，包含完整背景、问题描述、建议改进和最小复现\n3. 多Agent分工明确：main协调、xixi调研产出、aoao风险审查，协作链路已建立\n\n**[阻塞]**\n1. 当前无明确阻塞，但需要确认xixi和aoao的实时状态以获取最新进展\n2. 需要决定是否立即发布P1 issue，还是等待进一步证据补充\n\n**建议行动：**\n1. 立即检查并发布P1 diagnostics gap issue到GitHub\n2. 准备P2 docs PR作为跟进\n3. 继