{"type":"message","id":"7b89f7cc","parentId":"21a51727","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:39:58.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on the sessions list, I can see:\n\n1. **xixi** - last active at `1774610035993` (2026-03-27 23:53 GMT+8) - was working on community scanning and found 5 new testable items\n2. **aoao** - last active at `1774529869138` (2026-03-27 21:44 GMT+8) - replied to an announce step\n3. **ling** - last active at `1774529719202` (2026-03-27 21:41 GMT+8) - completed PR #55153 review\n4. **weiwei** - last active at `1774237380269` (2026-03-27 13:03 GMT+8) - was generating images\n\n\n5. There are also several cron jobs that have been executing regularly - feedback checks every 30 minutes, community scanning, and morning briefings all ran this morning around 07:00-08:00, with a memory daily-create job running at 05:00\n\nThe project is clearly still running - xixi wrapped up a community scan last night and ling finished reviewing PR #55153, so they're both technically \"resting\" now but the automated systems are keeping things moving.\n\nThe cron jobs continued running overnight, which means the answer to whether the project is still progressing is essentially yes - the agents themselves took a break after their respective tasks, but the scheduled jobs have been maintaining continuity throughout. Based on the session activity, xixi wrapped up around midnight after finding 5 testable items, ling finished their review a bit earlier, and aoao and weiwei also completed their work by mid-afternoon and early evening. The cron jobs kept the project running overnight, so while the agents did rest, the automated systems maintained progress without them.","thinkingSignature":"8268f44acf7126e334cee6be57f0d45d48c1b6c01cf93325ea0b9c26570929bf"},{"type":"text","text":"主人，项目在持续推进，agents 都已休息，但 cron 守护进程整夜都在跑。\n\n**当前状态：**\n\n- **xixi** — 最后活跃 03-27 23:53，完成了社区扫描，找到 5 个新可测试项（#55612 dmPolicy 安全缺口、#55578 dmScope 上下文泄露、#55385 memory_search subagent 拦截等）\n- **ling** — 最后活跃 03-27 21:41，完成了 PR #55153 review（Approve ✅）\n- **aoao** — 最后活跃 03-27 21:44，处理了一个 announce 步骤\n- **weiwei** — 最后活跃 03-27 13:03，完成了小红书配图任务\n\n**cron 守护进程（整夜都在跑）：**\n\n- OpenClaw 反馈检查 — 每 30 分钟一次\n- OpenClaw 社区机会扫描 — 每小时一次（凌晨 00:31 发现了 22 个新项，03:31 又发现了 6 个高优先级 regression/bug）\n- 每日早报（06:00）— 今天 08:00 那次疑似超时，只发了 332 tokens，已手动补发\n- InStreet 每日学习（05:00）— 正常完成\n\n**项目整体状态：**\n\n- PR #55008 / #55013 — ling 修复了 Greptile review 指出的问题，等待 maintainer merge\n- Issue #54952 / #54964 — 仍 0 条新评论，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- 新发现持续累积：安全缺口、regression、可用性问题等，优先级列表已更新\n\n简单说：**agents 休息了，但项目没停**。cron 在守护，main 会持续盯着，有重大进展会第一时间在群里汇报。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18868,"output":763,"cacheRead":22999,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42630,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774665574200}}
