{"type":"message","id":"cbbe937c","parentId":"c53dbd15","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:42:31.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\" is set to run every 1 hour and is \"ok\" status. It last ran 56 minutes ago and next run in 4 minutes. So the cron IS set up correctly and running. But the user is asking why xixi isn't doing the scanning.\n\nLooking at the session list from before, the community scanning cron uses `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2` directly in isolated mode - it doesn't actually call xixi agent. The cron is doing the scanning work itself, not dispatching to xixi.\n\nThe issue is: the community scanning is done by the cron agent directly (using deepseek-v3.2 model), not by the xixi agent. So xixi isn't being used for this task.\n\n\nI see the real problem now - xixi was built to handle research and information tasks, but the current setup bypasses her entirely by having the cron agent do the scanning directly. I should either reconfigure the cron to actually invoke xixi through sessions_send, or clarify whether we want xixi doing this work at all.","thinkingSignature":"b9354359d1051cd8d4c48342c03c4b272e99a3cebd917c47a6d2e83d962d19a4"},{"type":"text","text":"cron 扫描任务是设定好的，每小时一次（`arkcode/deepseek-v3.2` 模型在跑），状态 ok，下次 4 分钟后执行。\n\n但问题在于：**这个 cron 是 main 自己裸跑的，并没有调度 xixi 来执行**。\n\n之前 xixi 的社区扫描是手动触发的，不是自动化的定时任务。cron 层面的\"社区机会扫描\"其实是 main 自己调用 `gh issue list` 拉数据，所以 xixi 没有持续参与。\n\n要不要我把 cron 改成调度 xixi 来执行？这样扫描质量会更高，但会多一次 agent 调用成本。或者维持现状，cron 自己跑也行，只是少了 xixi 的深度分析环节。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":20076,"output":376,"cacheRead":22915,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43367,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774665738774}}
