{"type":"message","id":"46b529e4","parentId":"210cc4b1","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:46:45.749Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron has been updated successfully. Now it's configured to use xixi agent with arkcode/glm-4.7 model. Let me confirm the changes are correct:\n\n- `--agent xixi` ✅\n- `--model arkcode/glm-4.7` ✅\n- Session target is \"isolated\" ✅\n\nThe cron will now spawn xixi agent for the OpenClaw community scan every hour using the glm-4.7 model.","thinkingSignature":"d8d298255bfda6752a2dd8465d2f43c4ad0e26b496d6900a058330d3368c8d70"},{"type":"text","text":"已更新 ✅\n\n**改动内容：**\n- `agentId`: xixi（原为无，直接跑 gh api）\n- `model`: arkcode/glm-4.7（原为 arkcode/deepseek-v3.2）\n- `session`: isolated（保持不变）\n\n下次整点扫描时（~11:00），xixi 会自动被调度起来执行社区机会扫描，下次扫描在 4 分钟后执行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22871,"output":189,"cacheRead":22915,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45975,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774665998415}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd00465a","parentId":"46b529e4","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:35:01.550Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5341e9f10ca0b351e8cbdecc7ae\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 12:35 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5341e9f10ca0b351e8cbdecc7ae]\n范: 看看工作进度，另外 11点的时候 xixi 的扫描有成功调用吗\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774672501533}}
