{"type":"message","id":"a38fa57d","parentId":"8d1cc7f8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:42:15.741Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to schedule aoao to work on reviewing the high-priority items, particularly P44 (security vulnerability #55995). I should also check if any agents are not executing their tasks and schedule them directly.\n\nLet me first read the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md to understand what needs to be done, then spawn aoao to work on reviewing P44 (#55995).\n\nActually, looking at the cron setup:\n- xixi: community scanning (every 1h) ✅\n- aoao: not in cron\n- ling: not in cron\n- feedback check cron: every 30m\n\nThe issue is that there's no cron scheduled for aoao or ling to pick up the findings from xixi's scans.\n\n\nNow I'll spawn aoao to start reviewing the security vulnerability in #55995.","thinkingSignature":"f93a4a3835c24d6e2c1625df8eb3398edba992b59543e828affe48e3420a951a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h761fizlc6e1_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是 aoao（复核者）。你的任务是审查 OpenClaw 安全漏洞 #55995。\n\n**任务目标：**\n审查 GitHub issue #55995（/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard，CVSS 9.9/10），判断其可复现性和 issue 质量。\n\n**步骤：**\n1. 用 `gh issue view 55995 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json body,title,comments,labels` 获取详情\n2. 读 issue 正文，理解：什么问题、哪个代码路径、影响面\n3. 在本地 `/root/.openclaw/workspace` 的 openclaw 源码中定位相关代码（`openclaw pair approve` 相关）\n4. 验证漏洞逻辑是否成立\n5. 判断：这是一个真实的安全漏洞还是一个设计决策\n\n**交付：**\n回复给 main（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8），格式：\n- 状态：可信 / 不可信 / 需更多信息\n- 漏洞逻辑：成立/不成立，原因\n- 建议动作：发 issue 评论 / 发独立 security issue / 忽略\n- 如果值得发 issue，写好草稿正文\n\n**禁止：** 不要向飞书群发消息，只回复 main。","runtime":"subagent","agentId":"aoao","mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":493,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":55618,"totalTokens":56190,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"t