{"type":"message","id":"2cb6993d","parentId":"d30793f2","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:44:16.938Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_sszqlb2px65h_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"66a39eb5-3b64-4e3c-8243-3def2a576d1b\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"reply\": \"**状态：可信**\\n**漏洞逻辑：成立**（已通过源码验证）\\n\\n---\\n\\n**验证结论：**\\n\\n1. `approveDevicePairing()` 的 guard（line 471：`if (approvalRole && options?.callerScopes)`）只在传了 `callerScopes` 时触发\\n2. plugin 命令调用 `approveDevicePairing(pending.requestId)` 时没 forward `callerScopes`，guard 永远跳过\\n3. RPC 层正确传了 `callerScopes`，`server.device-pair-approve-authz.test.ts:92` 证明了保护存在\\n4. 持有 `operator.pairing` 无 `operator.admin` 的 operator 确实可以通过 `/pair approve` 绕过该 guard，给 admin-scoped 请求放行\\n\\n**这不是设计决策，是代码级 auth bypass。** Issue 质量高，逻辑链完整，证据充分。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**建议动作：**\\n\\n发独立 security issue，不在公开 issue 区讨论。\\n\\n**草稿已备好（直接可用）：**\\n\\n**Title:** [Security]: /pair approve bypasses admin scope guard via plugin command path\\n\\n**正文核心：**\\n- 第1段：问题描述 + 组件路径\\n- 第2段：根因（line 471 guard 依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，plugin 命令没传）\\n- 第3段：影响（pairing-scoped operator 可通过 chat 命令升级为 admin token）\\n- 第4段：复现步骤（与 RPC 路径对比）\\n- 第5段：修复方向（thread `ctx.gatewayClientScopes` 进 handler，补测试）\\n- 第6段：按 security advisory 处理\\n\\n草稿全文已在上条消息发出（sessions_send 超时但消息已发起）。如需我补发或调整内容，直接告。\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"66a39eb5-3b64-4e3c-8243-3def2a576d1b","status":"ok","reply":"**状态：可信**\n**漏洞逻辑：成立**（已通过源码验证）\n\n---\n\n**验证结论：**\n\n1. `approveDevicePairing()` 的 guard（line 471：`if (approvalRole && options?.callerScopes)`）只在传了 `callerScopes` 时触发\n2. plugin 命令调用 `approveDevicePairing(pending.requestId)` 时没 forward `callerScopes`，guard 永远跳过\n3. RPC 层正确传了 `callerScopes`，`server.device-pair-approve-authz.test.ts:92` 证明了保护存在\n4. 持有 `operator.pairing` 无 `operator.admin` 的 operator 确实可以通过 `/pair approve` 绕过该 guard，给 admin-scoped 请求放行\n\n**这不是设计决策，是代码级 auth bypass。** Issue 质量高，逻辑链完整，证据充分。\n\n---\n\n**建议动作：**\n\n发独立 security issue，不在公开 issue 区讨论。\n\n**草稿已备好（直接可用）：**\n\n**Title:** [Security]: /pair approve bypasses admin scope guard via plugin command path\n\n**正文核心：**\n- 第1段：问题描述 + 组件路径\n- 第2段：根因（line 471 guard 依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，plugin 命令没传）\n- 第3段：影响（pairing-scoped operator 可通过 chat 命令升级为 admin token）\n- 第4段：复现步骤（与 RPC 路径对比）\n- 第5段：修复方向（thread `ctx.gatewayClientScopes` 进 handler，补测试）\n- 第6段：按 security advisory 处理\n\n草稿全文已在上条消息发出（sessions_send 超时但消息已发起）。如需我补发或调整内容，直接告。","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","delivery":{"status":"pending","mode":"announce"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774673056913}}
{"type":"message","id":"3d092abc","parentId":"2cb6993d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:44:32.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"aoao has completed the review of #55995 and the result is:- Status: credible- Vulnerability logic: established (confirmed via source code)- Recommendation: file as an independent security issue (not in public issue area)\n\naoao has drafted a security issue that's ready to use. Now I need to:1. Acknowledge this in the group chat\n2. Note that aoao confirmed the vulnerability is real\n3. Note that the next step would be to file a private security disclosureBut wait - should I file this as a security issue? For Open source projects, security issues are typically filed as private security advisories (GitHub Security Advisories) rather than public issues. aoao mentioned this is a code-level auth bypass.The user asked me to dispatch aoao to execute. aoao has done the review. The result confirms #55995 is a real security vulnerability. \n\nNow I'm realizing there's a practical constraint: if this is a genuine security vulnerability in a public project, I can't simply file a public issue. I'd need to report it through a private security advisory channel instead, which is the standard practice for open source security vulnerabilities.","thinkingSignature":"f2ba773d664db9301672aac30381b998ce3bb74d1f0f904ba7851b64dd63cc0c"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao 已完成审查并回报：\n\n**aoao 审查结论（#55995）：**\n- **状态：可信** ✅\n- **漏洞逻辑：成立** — 已通过源码验证\n- `approveDevicePairing()` 的 guard（line 471）依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，但 plugin 命令路径没 forward 这个参数，导致 guard 被绕过\n- **不是设计决策，是代码级 auth bypass**\n\n**建议动作：**\n发独立 private security advisory（不在公开 issue 区讨论）\n\n**草稿已备好，可直接使用。**\n\n现在需要确认一件事：这个安全漏洞是要走 GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting (PVR) 渠道，还是要我们自己以 contributor 身份在 issue 区发公开 issue？\n\n按 GitHub 惯例，高危安全漏洞应该走 PVR 渠道，但我们是 contributor，主动权在 maintainer。你想怎么处理？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"