{"type":"message","id":"484a33a7","parentId":"3d092abc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:45:50.665Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-28 12:44 GMT+8] **状态：可信**\n**漏洞逻辑：成立**（已通过源码验证）\n\n---\n\n**验证结论：**\n\n1. `approveDevicePairing()` 的 guard（line 471：`if (approvalRole && options?.callerScopes)`）只在传了 `callerScopes` 时触发\n2. plugin 命令调用 `approveDevicePairing(pending.requestId)` 时没 forward `callerScopes`，guard 永远跳过\n3. RPC 层正确传了 `callerScopes`，`server.device-pair-approve-authz.test.ts:92` 证明了保护存在\n4. 持有 `operator.pairing` 无 `operator.admin` 的 operator 确实可以通过 `/pair approve` 绕过该 guard，给 admin-scoped 请求放行\n\n**这不是设计决策，是代码级 auth bypass。** Issue 质量高，逻辑链完整，证据充分。\n\n---\n\n**建议动作：**\n\n发独立 security issue，不在公开 issue 区讨论。\n\n**草稿已备好（直接可用）：**\n\n**Title:** [Security]: /pair approve bypasses admin scope guard via plugin command path\n\n**正文核心：**\n- 第1段：问题描述 + 组件路径\n- 第2段：根因（line 471 guard 依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，plugin 命令没传）\n- 第3段：影响（pairing-scoped operator 可通过 chat 命令升级为 admin token）\n- 第4段：复现步骤（与 RPC 路径对比）\n- 第5段：修复方向（thread `ctx.gatewayClientScopes` 进 handler，补测试）\n- 第6段：按 security advisory 处理\n\n草稿全文已在上条消息发出（sessions_send 超时但消息已发起）。如需我补发或调整内容，直接告。"}],"timestamp":1774673150633,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","sourceChannel":"unknown","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"13a8d979","parentId":"484a33a7","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:46:03.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This appears to be the aoao agent delivering its result. The message content is the aoao review conclusion about the security vulnerability. The user (范总) seems to be asking me what to do next - should we use PVR channel or public issue.\n\nBut wait - looking at the message, it seems like the aoao result was delivered back to me (main) in this group chat. The user didn't send a new message - this is just the aoao report being shown. But the timestamp shows [Sat 2026-03-28 12:44 GMT+8] which is the current time, and there's no new user message - this IS the aoao reply content coming through.\n\n\nI should present this finding to the user with a clear recommendation on the next step, and also explain the two paths forward for this vulnerability - either going through GitHub's private vulnerability reporting channel or posting it publicly as an issue.","thinkingSignature":"430c7a05b913dbc51b7cdc60ded854fc3f8733d28c763c1463db87508ccca169"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao 验证结论已收到，转述如下：\n\n---\n\n**🔐 安全漏洞 #55995 审查结果**\n\n| 项 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| **可信度** | ✅ 可信 |\n| **漏洞逻辑** | ✅ 成立（源码级 auth bypass） |\n| **根因** | `approveDevicePairing()` line 471 guard 依赖 `options?.callerScopes`，plugin 命令路径没 forward 该参数，guard 被绕过 |\n| **影响** | pairing-scoped operator 可通过 `/pair approve` 升级为 admin token |\n| **性质** | 不是设计决策，是真实代码漏洞 |\n\n---\n\n**下一步建议：**\n\n安全漏洞应该走 **GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting (PVR)** 渠道，不在公开 issue 区讨论。具体动作：\n\n1. 打开 `https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/new`\n2. 选择 \"Coordinated vulnerability disclosure\"\n3. 用 aoao 的草稿填充内容\n4. 提交后 maintainer 会在 90 天内私下处理\n\n**要我直接帮你在 GitHub 上提交这个 PVR 吗？** 草稿已经有了，直接贴就行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":431,"cacheRead":9602,"cacheWrite":47696,"totalTokens":57808,"cost":{"input":0,