{"type":"message","id":"ea7ddb64","parentId":"13a8d979","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:47:33.084Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b534198f54938b2587656a6fb91f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 12:47 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b534198f54938b2587656a6fb91f]\n范: 如果走 GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting (PVR) 渠道 流程是怎样的\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774673253069}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c5d2d1e","parentId":"ea7ddb64","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:47:44.607Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know the GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting (PVR) process. Let me explain it clearly.","thinkingSignature":"82d282a3fb3df432cf1ba08059903bbec3975f8abdef1d6330da643a7f39998a"},{"type":"text","text":"**GitHub PVR 渠道流程：**\n\n1. **提交漏洞报告** → 你（漏洞发现者）在 GitHub repo 页面点 `Security` → `Advisories` → `Draft a new security advisory`，填写：\n   - CVSS 评分（已有：9.9）\n   - 问题描述、受影响版本范围、复现步骤、修复方向\n   - **可以匿名或用任意 GitHub 账号提交**，不要求是 maintainer\n\n2. **GitHub 通知 maintainer** → maintainer 收到通知，有 90 天私下处理窗口\n\n3. **私下沟通修复** → maintainer 在 advisory 评论区和你沟通细节、确认修复方案\n\n4. **协调披露** → maintainer 决定何时公开发布 advisory（通常在 patch 释出后）\n\n5. **公开 advisory** → patch 发布后，GitHub 自动生成公开 security advisory 页面，你的贡献会被记录（计入 contributions）\n\n---\n\n**对你的实际影响：**\n\n- 漏洞发现者身份会被记录在 security advisory 里\n- contributor graph 会显示你在安全方面的贡献\n- 这是高质量的安全研究贡献，对冲击前 20 很有价值\n\n---\n\n**唯一要求：** 提交 PVR 后，在 patch 公开前**不要公开泄露漏洞细节**。\n\n要我帮你提交吗？aoao 已经把草稿准备好了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":306,"cacheRead":22915,"cacheWrite":35165,"totalTokens":58465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774673253076}}
