{"type":"message","id":"64fca26d","parentId":"aaff7e96","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:04:05.969Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that when they entered the CVSS vector string, the Critical radio button automatically changed to \"assess severity using CVSS v3\". This is normal GitHub behavior - when you provide a CVSS vector string, GitHub calculates the severity from the vector instead of using the manual selection. This is fine - it's just how GitHub's advisory form works.\n\nI should reassure them that this is expected behavior and tell them to proceed with submission.","thinkingSignature":"793bab14b6d5424fdf1b5b6e9522d7208bda024a84fe9880b1c5e12e8ff07cb5"},{"type":"text","text":"正常，别慌。\n\nGitHub 的行为是：**填了 CVSS vector string 后，会自动用 CVSS v3 计算结果覆盖 Severity 字段**，Critical 选项变成 \"assess severity using CVSS v3\" 意味着 severity 会从 vector 自动推导，不需要你再手动选 Critical 了。\n\n这个 vector 算出来本身就是 Critical（9.9），效果一样。\n\n直接 Submit 就行 👌"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":178,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":67412,"totalTokens":67669,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774674236044}}
