{"type":"message","id":"fdf3b570","parentId":"254effc5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:06:04.157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the project file has been updated. Let me also check if there's a morning briefing section I should update.\n\nLet me now respond to the user confirming the success and noting what happens next.","thinkingSignature":"d6ae5d9de8ed0d7d74610b9f4d01f2c1508efd7182b8cd0bd569ae494d7d09fc"},{"type":"text","text":"P44 已更新，记录了 GHSA 提交成功 ✅\n\n---\n\n**接下来会发生什么：**\n\n1. **GitHub 内部通知** maintainer 有新的 private security advisory（通常几小时内）\n2. **maintainer 有 90 天**私下处理窗口，会在 advisory 评论区联系你\n3. **协调修复后** maintainer 会发布 patch，然后 GHSA 自动公开\n4. 你的 GitHub contributions 会显示一个 security advisory 提交记录\n\n---\n\n**现在项目状态更新：**\n\n| 优先级 | 任务 | 状态 |\n|---|---|---|\n| P44 | /pair approve auth bypass（安全漏洞） | ✅ **GHSA 已提交** |\n| P45 | weixin regression（message action=send 被误判为 poll） | 🔍 待推进 |\n| P46-P145 | 社区扫描新发现 | 🔍 待处理 |\n\n下一个建议推进项：**P45（weixin release blocker）**，这个是 Beta release blocker，优先级很高。要调度 ling 去 review 吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":46952,"output":254,"cacheRead":22915,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70121,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774674355579}}
