{"type":"message","id":"603173ad","parentId":"97c1b811","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:29:14.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `gh issue view` commands returned null for some fields. Let me try again with different queries to check the status.\n\nLet me check our open PRs and issues more carefully.","thinkingSignature":"ac9079a2e35436837ddc7561894ab0f8947f145c66ed66afb6cbb7a567f10f2c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_60jyydxwe0mv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== #54952 ===\" && gh issue view 54952 --repo openclaw/openclaw 2>&1 | grep -E \"state|评论|comment|Review\" | head -5\necho \"=== #54964 ===\" && gh issue view 54964 --repo openclaw/openclaw 2>&1 | grep -E \"state|评论|comment|Review\" | head -5\necho \"=== #55008 ===\" && gh pr view 55008 --repo openclaw/openclaw 2>&1 | grep -E \"state|Merge|Review|Approved\" | head -5\necho \"=== #55013 ===\" && gh pr view 55013 --repo openclaw/openclaw 2>&1 | grep -E \"state|Merge|Review|Approved\" | head -5"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":57661,"output":233,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80519,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774675748176,"responseId":"06169a248fd807d25a0b9cfec1eb7694"}}
{"type":"message","id":"778fd923","parentId":"603173ad","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:29:19.319Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_60jyydxwe0mv_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== #54952 ===\nstate:\tOPEN\ncomments:\t0\n=== #54964 ===\ntitle:\tSession enters zombie state after embedded agent init failure (deactivated_workspace) — no auto-recovery\nstate:\tOPEN\ncomments:\t0\nWhen an embedded agent fails to initialize (e.g., \\`deactivated_workspace\\` error), the corresponding session enters a **zombie state**:\n3. The session is left in a broken state: marked \"initialized\" but not actually running\n=== #55008 ===\nstate:\tOPEN\n=== #55013 ===\nstate:\tOPEN"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4640,"aggregated":"=== #54952 ===\nstate:\tOPEN\ncomments:\t0\n=== #54964 ===\ntitle:\tSession enters zombie state after embedded agent init failure (deactivated_workspace) — no auto-recovery\nstate:\tOPEN\ncomments:\t0\nWhen an embedded agent fails to initialize (e.g., \\`deactivated_workspace\\` error), the corresponding session enters a **zombie state**:\n3. The session is left in a broken state: marked \"initialized\" but not actually running\n=== #55008 ===\nstate:\tOPEN\n=== #55013 ===\nstate:\tOPEN","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774675759296}}
{"type":"message","id":"60d0be7e","parentId":"778fd923","timestamp":"2026-03-28T05:29:41.628Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the status of our issues/PRs:\n- #54952: OPEN, 0 comments - still waiting for maintainer feedback\n- #54964: OPEN, 0 comments - still waiting for maintainer feedback\n- #55008: OPEN - still waiting for merge (greptile commented)\n- #55013: OPEN - still waiting for merge (greptile + chatgpt-codex commented)\n\nNow let me add a comment to #55994 about weixin. But first I need to understand the weixin issue better.\n\nFrom what I know:\n- The user on 2026.3.13 gets \"Poll fields require action 'poll'\" when doing `action=send`\n\n\n- The same error was added to Telegram in commit 6dfd39c3 (merged around March 5, 2026) at the `runMessageAction` level, line 767-769\n- This check validates whether `hasPollCreationParams(params)` when `action === \"send\"` and throws an error if poll creation params are detected\n- The bug is that this check applies globally across all channels, not just Telegram, so weixin gets falsely flagged\n\nNow I need to add this analysis as a comment to issue #55994 to provide context for the maintainers.","thinkingSignature":"98794d18f20afcf3c2f6d7830dee762f3a564012e925f8e3db0ce568a3fadace"},{"type":"text","text":"好，同步一下当前状态：\n\n**P44 漏洞（#56173 GHSA）：** ✅ 已确认还在 2026.3.24，line 471 guard 代码完全一致，maintainer 尚未修复。\n\n**其它 issue/PR 状态：**\n- #54952（P1 Diagnostics gap）：OPEN，0 评论，等 maintainer\n- #54964（P1 Session zombie）：OPEN，0 评论，等 maintainer\n- #55008（message channel docs）：OPEN，Greptile review 过，等 merge\n- #55013（feishu routing docs）：OPEN，Greptile + Codex review 过，等 merge\n\n现在追加评论到 #55994：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7iafgk7qtxx8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue comment 55994 --repo openclaw/openclaw --body \"## 补充分析（OpenClaw 2026.3.24 验证）\n\n在 v2026.3.24 中确认此 bug 仍然存在。根因定位如下：\n\n### 根因\ncommit \\`6dfd39c3\\`（Harden Telegram poll gating）在 \\`src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts\\` line 767-769 增加了全局 guard：\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\&\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) {\n  throw new Error('Poll fields require action \\\"poll\\\"...');\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n这个 guard 放在 \\`runMessageAction()\\` **入口处**，而非 Telegram 专用路径内。因此它会拦截**所有通道**的 send 请求，包括 weixin。\n\n### 问题\n对于 weixin 通道，即使调用方没有传任何 poll 相关字段，\\`hasPollCreationParams(params)\\` 仍可能在某些情况下返回 true（比如参数解析逻辑差异或 weixin 通道特有的字段被误识别为 poll 参数），导致纯文本 send 被错误拒绝。\n\n### 修复建议\n将 poll 参数校验下放到 Telegram 专用 handler 内，而不是放在全局入口：\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\n// src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts\n\n// 当前（有问题）：\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\&\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 全局拦截\n\n// 建议改为：\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\&\\& channel === \\\"telegram\\\" \\&\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 仅 Telegram\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n或者在 weixin handler 入口单独加 channel 判断。\n\n---\\n*Reviewed by contributor via community analysis*\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":58034,"output":794,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81453,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774675759320,"responseId":"06169a2fc54d1cc82fc3da3a494e26c3"}}
