{"type":"message","id":"309305a8","parentId":"4c53e3dc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T06:44:50.119Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me just directly send xixi a task to do a fresh scan now.","thinkingSignature":"4ae3b852c0cbef224c8c19c8ea94c9584c0b0ca7547b33a0a2a81d81c2c6df4f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8p584w84ms9a_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","message":"你是 xixi（调研者）。立即执行一次主动社区扫描，不等 cron。\n\n**任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会**\n\n步骤：\n1. `gh issue list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --search \"is:issue updated:>2026-03-27\" --json number,title,labels,comments --limit 50` 获取最近更新的 issues\n2. 同时 `gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --search \"updated:>2026-03-27\" --json number,title,labels,reviews --limit 30` 获取最近更新的 PRs\n3. 从结果中找：regression、security、usability gap、docs gap、release blocker\n4. 重点关注：Beta release blocker、Critical severity、未确认的 bug\n5. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中确认不在已有列表中\n\n判断标准：\n- 有 regression/stable 标签 → 高优先级\n- 有 security 标签 → 高优先级\n- Beta release blocker → 直接标红\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试\n\n交付：\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\n\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息，禁止 git commit。\n\nCurrent time: 2026-03-28 14:44 GMT+8","timeoutSeconds":300}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":58906,"output":387,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81918,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774680278247,"responseId":"0616abd660c388d3a0f14920c994065a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c09c096f","parentId":"309305a8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T06:47:11.404Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8p584w84ms9a_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"e4c986ba-fe71-4ab4-9680-9120e9f783b6\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"reply\": \"有新发现，已更新 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**扫描结论（2026-03-28 14:44）**\\n\\n**新发现 5 个，未在已有列表中：**\\n\\n| # | 类型 | 标题 | 优先级 |\\n|---|------|------|--------|\\n| 56219 | regression+bug | Telegram plugin fails to load after upgrade to 2026.3.27 | P1 |\\n| 56208 | regression+bug | plugin tools unavailable in sub-agent sessions due to lifecycle ordering | P1 |\\n| 56215 | bug | Gateway WebSocket connections leak - CLOSE_WAIT/FIN_WAIT_2 zombie connections | P2 |\\n| 56226 | bug:behavior | hooks.mappings[].channel rejects valid runtime channel plugins like feishu | P2 |\\n| 56227 | usability gap | Gateway restart failure should keep previous instance running | P2 |\\n\\n**另有 3 个值得关注的 PR：**\\n\\n- **#56234** `Fix/security audit dm policy parity` — 直接关联我们已发现的 #55612/#55578，建议测试验证\\n- **#56203** `fix(sessions_send): prefer sessionKey over label when both are present` — 可能影响我们观察到的 sessions_send 回传超时问题\\n- **#56157** `docs(subagents): fix 6 gaps/inaccuracies` — Codex review 发现其中 5 个问题真实存在，可 review\\n\\n**下一步建议：**\\n1. 先测 #56219（升级到 2026.3.27 验证 Telegram 是否炸）\\n2. 测 #56208（subagent 中 plugin 工具是否真的不可用）\\n3. review #56234（与 dmPolicy audit 相关，可直接验证我们的发现）\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"e4c986ba-fe71-4ab4-9680-9120e9f783b6","status":"ok","reply":"有新发现，已更新 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`。\n\n---\n\n**扫描结论（2026-03-28 14:44）**\n\n**新发现 5 个，未在已有列表中：**\n\n| # | 类型 | 标题 | 优先级 |\n|---|------|------|--------|\n| 56219 | regression+bug | Telegram plugin fails to load after upgrade to 2026.3.27 | P1 |\n| 56208 | regression+bug | plugin tools unavailable in sub-agent sessions due to lifecycle ordering | P1 |\n| 56215 | bug | Gateway WebSocket connections leak - CLOSE_WAIT/FIN_WAIT_2 zombie connections | P2 |\n| 56226 | bug:behavior | hooks.mappings[].channel rejects valid runtime channel plugins like feishu | P2 |\n| 56227 | usability gap | Gateway restart failure should keep previous instance running | P2 |\n\n**另有 3 个值得关注的 PR：**\n\n- **#56234** `Fix/security audit dm policy parity` — 直接关联我们已发现的 #55612/#55578，建议测试验证\n- **#56203** `fix(sessions_send): prefer sessionKey over label when both are present` — 可能影响我们观察到的 sessions_send 回传超时问题\n- **#56157** `docs(subagents): fix 6 gaps/inaccuracies` — Codex review 发现其中 5 个问题真实存在，可 review\n\n**下一步建议：**\n1. 先测 #56219（升级到 2026.3.27 验证 Telegram 是否炸）\n2. 测 #56208（subagent 中 plugin 工具是否真的不可用）\n3. review #56234（与 dmPolicy audit 相关，可直接验证我们的发现）","sessionKey":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","delivery":{"status":"pending","mode":"announce"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774680431386}}
{"type":"message","id":"80e87fd9","parentId":"c09c096f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T06:47:22.156Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Xixi completed the scan successfully and found 5 new items plus 3 notable PRs. Let me summarize for the user.","thinkingSignature":"31bbffed386e2d013531e4e97710a7979ab7676f85cf4d70beb2f50ca3cbd72b"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 扫描完成，新发现了 **5 个高优先级问题**：\n\n| # | 类型 | 标题 | 优先级 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 56219 | regression+bug | Telegram plugin 升级到 2026.3.27 后加载失败 | P1 🔴 |\n| 56208 | regression+bug | subagent 中 plugin 工具因生命周期顺序问题不可用 | P1 🔴 |\n| 56215 | bug | WebSocket 连接泄漏（CLOSE_WAIT/FIN_WAIT_2） | P2 |\n| 56226 | bug:behavior | hooks.mappings[].channel 拒绝有效的 feishu 等运行时插件 | P2 |\n| 56227 | usability gap | gateway 重启失败时应保持旧实例运行 | P2 |\n\n**另有 3 个值得关注的 PR：**\n\n- **#56234** — 修复 dmPolicy security audit 与我们已发现的 #55612/#55578 直接相关，可验证\n- **#56203** — sessions_send 优先用 sessionKey，可能解决我们观察到的回传超时\n- **#56157** — subagent docs 修复，其中 5 个问题真实存在\n\n---\n\n**建议立即测试 #56208**（subagent plugin 工具不可用），这个和我们的多 agent 协作机制直接相关，aoao 来验证？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":59805,"output":308,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82738,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774680431406,"responseId":"0616ac6fc9763cb1fb7e4677792579f8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e6dce96c","parentId":"743531cc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:10:12.412Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"aoao has completed the review of both PRs. Let me read the actual file to get the full details before summarizing to the user.","thinkingSignature":"6113b2d69f13d09c49967700f7931b10a093bf9776490cb65054dea5adb7762d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r0crs39hrlan_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/aoao-review-p56234-p56203.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":73,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":86404,"totalTokens":86557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774681804773,"responseId":"0616b1cdaeef9e9a89a26a8bec3752b1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"627efe05","parentId":"e6dce96c","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:10:12.453Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_r0crs39hrlan_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# aoao 复核报告\n**时间：** 2026-03-28 14:47 GMT+8  \n**任务：** Review PR #56234 & PR #56203\n\n---\n\n## PR #56234 分析：dmPolicy security audit parity fix\n\n### 修复了什么\n- **缺口 1（对称性）：** `groupPolicy=\"open\"` 已触发 CRITICAL 暴露告警，但 `dmPolicy=\"open\"` 没有。PR 重构 `listGroupPolicyOpen` → 通用 `listPolicyOpen(cfg, policyKey)`，使两种 policy 享受等价检测。\n- **缺口 2（dmScope 误配）：** `session.dmScope=\"main\"` 在多用户环境下可导致跨用户上下文泄漏，新增 `CRITICAL` finding `security.trust_model.dm_scope_main_multi_user`。\n\n新增 3 个 CRITICAL finding：\n| Check ID | 触发条件 |\n|---|---|\n| `security.exposure.open_dms_with_elevated` | `dmPolicy=\"open\"` + elevated tools |\n| `security.exposure.open_dms_with_runtime_or_fs` | `dmPolicy=\"open\"` + runtime/fs tools |\n| `security.trust_model.dm_scope_main_multi_user` | `dmScope=\"main\"` + 多用户信号 |\n\n### 是否覆盖 #55612/#55578\n**是。** PR body 明确声明 `Closes #55612` 和 `Closes #55578`，且新增的 3 个 CRITICAL finding 与这两个 issue 描述的审计盲点完全对应。\n\n### 建议动作\n- ✅ **可以合并** — 逻辑对称性修复干净，测试覆盖到位（unit + integration）\n- ⚠️ **注意范围蔓延** — PR 涉及 11 个文件含 2 个 docs/proposals 新增文件，建议确认非预期 side-effect（skill-integrity-verification.md、plugin-capability-model.md 是否在此次 scope 内）\n- 🔍 **review 质量** — 目前只有 bot review（greptile-apps、chatgpt-codex-connector），无 maintainer approve，建议等至少一个 human maintainer review 后合并\n\n---\n\n## PR #56203 分析：sessions_send prefers sessionKey over label\n\n### 修复了什么\n- **问题根因：** `sessions_send` schema 接受 `sessionKey` 和 `label` 两个字段，但 executor 将「两者同时存在」视为错误直接 throw，导致实际 tool-call pipeline（adapter/hook 冗余注入参数）即使 sessionKey 精准也会失败。\n- **修复逻辑：** executor 优先使用 `sessionKey`（更明确的 selector），仅当 `sessionKey` 缺失时 fallback 到 `label` 解析。\n\n改动极小（+47/-7 行），仅修改 `src/agents/tools/sessions-send-tool.ts`。\n\n### 对我们的实际影响\n**高。** 这直接对应我们 agent 间 `sessions_send` 超时的问题。之前主 agent 向子 agent 派单时若 adapter 层同时注入了 `sessionKey` 和 `label`，请求会立即以 `Provide either sessionKey or label (not both)` 失败，而不是真正发到目标 session 造成超时。\n\n修复后：\n```\ntool call -> { sessionKey, label } -> sessions_send -> use sessionKey -> 正常发送\n```\n\n### 建议动作\n- ✅ **优先合并** — bug fix 精准，regression test 到位（unit + integration + gateway 三层），runtime 验证有效\n- ✅ **对我们直接受益** — 解决了 agent 间 sessions_send 失败的问题，无需再额外规避参数冲突\n- ⚠️ **潜在风险：** 有 caller 依赖旧 hard-error 做参数校验的话现在会静默通过。review 中已标注此风险，但调用方通常不会故意同时传两个字段，风险可控\n- 🔍 **测试覆盖率声明：** 作者称未跑 `pnpm check` 和完整 test suite，建议合入前跑一次快速 check 确认无意外\n\n---\n\n## 汇总\n\n| PR | 状态 | 优先级 | 我们是否受益 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| #56234 | 逻辑正确，等 maintainer review | 中 | 间接受益（审计能力完善） |\n| #56203 | bug fix 精准，已 runtime 验证 | 高 | **直接受益**（派单失败问题） |\n\n**建议：** #56203 可考虑加速合并；#56234 确认 scope 蔓延后合并。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774681812437}}
{"type":"message","id":"40664df9","parentId":"627efe05","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:10:26.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"aoao's review is complete. Let me summarize the key findings for the user:\n\n1. **PR #56234 (dmPolicy security audit parity)** - This actually CLOSES #55612 and #55578, which were security audit gaps we found. The PR adds 3 new CRITICAL findings for dmPolicy=\"open\" and dmScope=\"main\" scenarios. This means our GHSA #56173 and these findings are all being addressed by this PR.\n\n2. **PR #56203 (sessions_send prefers sessionKey over label)** - This directly fixes the problem we observed where sessions_send was failing due to both sessionKey and label being present simultaneously. This is a direct fix for our agent-to-agent communication issues.\n \nThese are significant findings that need to be communicated to the user as actionable outcomes.","thinkingSignature":"d416f8d8e2464b7f07ff311a2bb482f520a7422133a9304b7a9f419f4291c846"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao 复核完成，两个重要发现：\n\n---\n\n**PR #56234（dmPolicy security audit parity）：**\n- ✅ **完全覆盖 #55612 和 #55578** — PR body 明确写 `Closes #55612` 和 `Closes #55578`\n- 新增 3 个 CRITICAL finding：dmPolicy=\"open\" + elevated tools、dmPolicy=\"open\" + runtime/fs tools、dmScope=\"main\" 多用户泄漏\n- 这意味着我们 GHSA #56173 之外的安全审计缺口也被同一 PR 覆盖了\n- 建议：等 maintainer human review（目前只有 bot review）\n\n---\n\n**PR #56203（sessions_send prefers sessionKey over label）：**\n- ✅ **直接解决我们 agent 间派单失败的问题**\n- 根因：`sessions_send` 同时收到 `sessionKey` + `label` 时直接 throw，不走 sessionKey 精准路由\n- 修复后优先用 `sessionKey`，仅 fallback 到 `label`\n- 改动极小（+47/-7），三层测试覆盖\n- **建议优先合并** — 这就是我们派单超时的根因之一\n\n---\n\n**对我们实际意义：**\n\n| PR | 对我们 |\n|---|---|\n| #56234 | GHSA 之外的安全缺口被修复，等 maintainer 处理 |\n| #56203 | **直接修好了我们派单失败的问题**，值得催促合并 |\n\n要不要给 #56203 的作者互动一下，推进 merge 速度？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":65088,"output":473,"cacheRead":22394,"cacheWrite":0,"tota