{"type":"message","id":"6854cc40","parentId":"50b8e25b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:14:14.227Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_rgg2t3phbzg2_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"56247\tfix(config): allow any channel plugin id in hooks.mappings[].channel (\tw-sss\t\n56244\tfix: guard against duplicate Feishu tool registration on config hot-re\tpgsev77\t\n56243\tfix(cli): respect current agent workspace for skills install (#56161)\tw-sss\t\n56242\tfix: add CJK error patterns to failover classification\ttomcatzh\t\n56241\tfix: Config schema rejects legacy messages.tts.edge while docs/types s\tdagangtj\t\n56240\tfix(plugins): reuse active registry for sub-agent tool resolution\tGodsBoy\t\n56239\tfeat(tts): add local CLI TTS plugin\tsolar2ain\t\n56234\tfix(security): extend audit to flag dmPolicy=open and session.dmScope=\tninglinLiu\t\n56232\tfix(acpx): retain named sessions on queue owner unavailable\tjlxyfll\t\n56224\tfeat: add pluggable compaction provider registry\tDhruvBhatia0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":525,"aggregated":"56247\tfix(config): allow any channel plugin id in hooks.mappings[].channel (\tw-sss\t\n56244\tfix: guard against duplicate Feishu tool registration on config hot-re\tpgsev77\t\n56243\tfix(cli): respect current agent workspace for skills install (#56161)\tw-sss\t\n56242\tfix: add CJK error patterns to failover classification\ttomcatzh\t\n56241\tfix: Config schema rejects legacy messages.tts.edge while docs/types s\tdagangtj\t\n56240\tfix(plugins): reuse active registry for sub-agent tool resolution\tGodsBoy\t\n56239\tfeat(tts): add local CLI TTS plugin\tsolar2ain\t\n56234\tfix(security): extend audit to flag dmPolicy=open and session.dmScope=\tninglinLiu\t\n56232\tfix(acpx): retain named sessions on queue owner unavailable\tjlxyfll\t\n56224\tfeat: add pluggable compaction provider registry\tDhruvBhatia0","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":17746