{"type":"message","id":"5b16f204","parentId":"3f4234f1","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:15:16.183Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me think about what to do next. The user said to continue with my thinking. \n\nI've:\n1. Commented on PR #56203 and #56247 to help them get reviewed\n2. Updated the project tracking file\n\nWhat else should I do? I should think about whether to:\n1. Have xixi research more issues to find new opportunities\n2. Do something about the open issues we have\n3. Check on our existing published issues for feedback\n\nActually, I should think about the next logical step. The user授权 me to keep pushing. The current flow is:\n- xixi researches new issues\n- aoao reviews PRs we find\n- main coordinates and engages\n\n\n- \nLooking at what's actually working, the small PRs with minimal changes and clear justifications are getting attention and merged faster than the larger ones. For the OpenClaw project specifically, I'm seeing a different dynamic though—the maintainers are already actively merging small bug fixes quickly, so our comparative advantage really lies in identifying real problems and filing issues that matter rather than just doing reviews.\n\nThe highest impact move right now would be finding and properly documenting new bugs before anyone else notices them. Given that PR engagement helped push #56203 forward, I could keep building momentum there and with other small fixes, but the real leverage is spotting the next untracked issue and getting it to the maintainers with a solid problem statement first. Let me have xixi scan for more high-quality PR opportunities while we're in this active engagement window, then I'll assess what we should tackle next based on what surfaces.","thinkingSignature":"2f67a1a1f6cfb2066707a44e31b5e50e588bcd4162627d62959384eaa1706b53"},{"type":"text","text":"项目记录已更新。接下来让 xixi 去扫一圈，看看还有没有值得支持的小 PR，顺便观察一下已发 issue 有没有新反馈。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rsm8buo12x42_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","message":"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 最近活跃的小型 open PR（size:S 或 size:XS），找那种改动精准、但缺人 review 的。\n\n要求：\n1. 用 gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --limit 50 拉最近 50 个 open PR\n2. 筛选 size:S 或 size:XS，label 有 \"bug\" 或 \"fix\" 的\n3. 排除已有 maintainer review 的（看 reviewDecision 不是空的）\n4. 每个 PR 评估：\n   - 改动是否精准（+50行以内）\n   - 是否对应真实 bug 或已知 issue\n   - 对我们的实际价值（是否直接影响我们的使用场景）\n5. 列出 top 3 最值得 main 出手支持的 PR，说明理由\n\n回报格式：\n状态：完成\n产出：top 3 PR 列表 + 支持理由\n建议：是否需要现在发评论\n\n这是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的一部分。返回结果给 main。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32038,"output":622,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55285,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682094245,"responseId":"0616b2eea6ce9e2c7009ed2178b90d57"}}
