{"type":"message","id":"11fd9e6a","parentId":"2e9f109d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:17.260Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good list. Let me look at some specific ones that seem most valuable. I need to prioritize:\n\n1. Small size (S/XS)\n2. No reviewDecision yet (empty = no maintainer review)\n3. High value to our use case\n4. Clear bug fix\n\nLet me look at the most interesting ones:\n\n1. **#56244** - fix: guard against duplicate Feishu tool registration on config hot-reload - size:XS, channel:feishu, no review yet\n2. **#56250** - fix: enable internal hooks by default - size:XS, no review yet\n3. **#56223** - fix: enable internal hooks by default - size:XS, no review yet\n4. **#56204** - fix: restore getApiKey callback after streamFn override (#55816) - size:XS, agents, references #55816 (which is a known issue)\n\n\n5. **#56158** - Feishu: guard against duplicate tool registration on config hot-reload - size:XS, channel:feishu\n6. **#56167** - fix(feishu): suppress NO_REPLY silent token before Feishu API calls - size:S, channel:feishu\n7. **#56186** - fix(ui): preserve config save error after loadChannels refresh (#53636) - size:XS\n\nI should prioritize the Feishu-related ones since they're directly relevant to our use case, especially #56244 and #56158 which both address duplicate tool registration issues.\n\nThe NO_REPLY token fix in #56167 is also interesting. Looking at the current status, I've already worked on #56203 and #56247, so #56244 and #56158 are the most actionable Feishu fixes to pursue next.","thinkingSignature":"48d5dbaf7f85597d433ac1b33fac6921fde848b6297f8f2bb5c5166779f042dd"},{"type":"text","text":"从列表里挑几个最值得支持的。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lchookhmskh6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56244 --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.' && echo \"---\" && gh pr view 56204 --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.' && echo \"---\" && gh pr view 56250 --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38199,"output":496,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682164118,"responseId":"0616b334d45aa60d5988f21ce76fb13e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f538b848","parentId":"11fd9e6a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:17.383Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lchookhmskh6_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"no git remotes found\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":69,"aggregated":"no git remotes found\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774682177358}}
{"type":"message","id":"4f105f3c","parentId":"f538b848","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:21.140Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The workdir issue again. Let me try without workdir.","thinkingSignature":"0288051b136ef3b44472c553ee239603342176535fa351a706d039a8c1074a38"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_46ryc7nx0rup_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56244 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38723,"output":67,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61415,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682177384,"responseId":"0616b341610b2c4c9e6946c7f5a6c4de"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2d1ab77d","parentId":"4f105f3c","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:21.663Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_46ryc7nx0rup_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Problem\\n\\nFeishu plugin tools re-register repeatedly on config hot-reload (#56114). Every time the config changes and triggers a gateway reload, `registerFull()` is called again, causing all 7 `registerFeishu*Tools()` functions to execute repeatedly and register duplicate tools.\\n\\n## Root Cause\\n\\nIn `extensions/feishu/index.ts`, the `registerFull()` callback has no deduplication protection. The plugin system re-invokes each plugin's `register()` on config hot-reload, and `registerFull` blindly re-registers all tools every time.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nAdded a module-level `feishuToolsRegistered` boolean guard in `extensions/feishu/index.ts`. On first call, `registerFull()` executes normally and sets the flag to `true`. Subsequent calls return immediately. `setRuntime` and `registerChannel` are unaffected.\\n\\nChanges: 1 file, 4 lines added.\\n\\n## Testing\\n\\nManual verification: config hot-reload no longer triggers duplicate tool registration.\\n\\nFixes #56114\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"1d76db\",\"description\":\"Channel integration: feishu\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACW9MMRQ\",\"name\":\"channel: feishu\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: guard against duplicate Feishu tool registration on config hot-reload\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56244\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":484,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"## Problem\\n\\nFeishu plugin tools re-register repeatedly on config hot-reload (#56114). Every time the config changes and triggers a gateway reload, `registerFull()` is called again, causing all 7 `registerFeishu*Tools()` functions to execute repeatedly and register duplicate tools.\\n\\n## Root Cause\\n\\nIn `extensions/feishu/index.ts`, the `registerFull()` callback has no deduplication protection. The plugin system re-invokes each plugin's `register()` on config hot-reload, and `registerFull` blindly re-registers all tools every time.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nAdded a module-level `feishuToolsRegistered` boolean guard in `extensions/feishu/index.ts`. On first call, `registerFull()` executes normally and sets the flag to `true`. Subsequent calls return immediately. `setRuntime` and `registerChannel` are unaffected.\\n\\nChanges: 1 file, 4 lines added.\\n\\n## Testing\\n\\nManual verification: config hot-reload no longer triggers duplicate tool registration.\\n\\nFixes #56114\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"1d76db\",\"description\":\"Channel integration: feishu\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACW9MMRQ\",\"name\":\"channel: feishu\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: guard against duplicate Feishu tool registration on config hot-reload\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56244\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774682181645}}
{"type":"message","id":"8450d82f","parentId":"2d1ab77d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:27.941Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is excellent! #56244 fixes #56114, which I actually have in my tracking as P117 - \"Feishu plugin tools re-register repeatedly on config hot-reload\". And we already have #56114 as a known issue. This is a great one to support because:1. It's XS (1 file, 4 lines)\n2. It directly fixes a known issue (#56114) that we already track\n3. It's a clear bug fix\n4. No review decision yet\n\nLet me also check #56204 which fixes #55816 (pi-* 0.63.0 regression).","thinkingSignature":"edf5615885dddb3f9b6f6083ef6d8f78e8135a260bd0d88bc4103f6ca5802855"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nk1bb3b5ozed_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56204 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39162,"output":180,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61967,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682181665,"responseId":"0616b34584430200509446d992271e84"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6648d65d","parentId":"8450d82f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:28.437Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nk1bb3b5ozed_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"Fixes #55816\\n\\n## Problem\\nThe getApiKey callback was being removed when streamFn was overridden in the custom provider runner, causing authentication failures.\\n\\n## Solution\\nRestore the getApiKey callback after the streamFn override to preserve authentication functionality.\\n\\n## Testing\\n- Verified callback is preserved after streamFn override\\n- Addresses Greptile P2 review comments\\n\\n## Branch Info\\n- Created from: upstream/main (2026-03-28 13:45)\\n- Commits: 3 (fix + P2 fixes + TODO comment)\\n- Replaces: #56185 (closed - accidentally merged private memory files)\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"5319e7\",\"description\":\"Agent runtime and tooling\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACWDenbg\",\"name\":\"agents\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: restore getApiKey callback after streamFn override (#55816)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56204\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":456,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"Fixes #55816\\n\\n## Problem\\nThe getApiKey callback was being removed when streamFn was overridden in the custom provider runner, causing authentication failures.\\n\\n## Solution\\nRestore the getApiKey callback after the streamFn override to preserve authentication functionality.\\n\\n## Testing\\n- Verified callback is preserved after streamFn override\\n- Addresses Greptile P2 review comments\\n\\n## Branch Info\\n- Created from: upstream/main (2026-03-28 13:45)\\n- Commits: 3 (fix + P2 fixes + TODO comment)\\n- Replaces: #56185 (closed - accidentally merged private memory files)\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"5319e7\",\"description\":\"Agent runtime and tooling\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACWDenbg\",\"name\":\"agents\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: restore getApiKey callback after streamFn override (#55816)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56204\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774682188415}}
{"type":"message","id":"e7c26a3a","parentId":"6648d65d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:33.102Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! #56204 fixes #55816, which I have in my tracking as P57. It's the pi-* 0.63.0 regression. This is another great one to support because:\n1. XS size (very small fix)\n2. Fixes a known issue we track\n3. Clear bug fix with regression label\n4. No review yet\n\nNow let me also look at #56250 (internal hooks by default).","thinkingSignature":"6e994fbf4a4962d50b07a7b8c72630865af465a228f08f1a5d6ec5fa17d64204"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mtcu7jtzda5n_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56250 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json title,body,state,reviewDecision,labels,url --jq '.'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39614,"output":144,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62383,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682188438,"responseId":"0616b34cc332d6b83f1e3009b8d64dce"}}
{"type":"message","id":"336b5975","parentId":"e7c26a3a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:34.098Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mtcu7jtzda5n_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Problem\\n\\nsession-memory hook not loading: `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined` instead of `true` (#55929). Bundled hooks (including `session-memory`) show as \\\"ready\\\" in `openclaw hooks check`, but are never actually loaded at runtime because `loadInternalHooks()` returns early when the config value is `undefined`.\\n\\n## Root Cause\\n\\nMultiple locations check `hooks.internal.enabled` with falsy comparison (`!x` or `=== true`). When the user has not explicitly set `hooks.internal.enabled` in their config, the value is `undefined`, which fails all these checks.\\n\\nAffected locations:\\n- `src/hooks/loader.ts:69` - `if (!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` -- skips all hook loading\\n- `src/gateway/server-startup.ts:167` - `if (params.cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` -- skips startup hook init\\n- `src/plugins/registry.ts:378` - `=== true` -- skips hook system registration\\n- `src/security/audit-extra.sync.ts:531` - `=== true` -- audit reports hooks as disabled\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nChanged all four locations from truthy/strict-true checks to `!== false`. This makes internal hooks enabled by default, only disabled when the user explicitly sets `hooks.internal.enabled: false`.\\n\\nChanges: 4 files, 5 lines changed.\\n\\n## Testing\\n\\n- `openclaw hooks check` continues to work (no behavioral change)\\n- Bundled hooks now load by default without requiring explicit config\\n- Users can still disable with `hooks.internal.enabled: false`\\n\\nFixes #55929\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"d4c5f9\",\"description\":\"Gateway runtime\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACV-EDaQ\",\"name\":\"gateway\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default when not explicitly disabled\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56250\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":904,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"## Problem\\n\\nsession-memory hook not loading: `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined` instead of `true` (#55929). Bundled hooks (including `session-memory`) show as \\\"ready\\\" in `openclaw hooks check`, but are never actually loaded at runtime because `loadInternalHooks()` returns early when the config value is `undefined`.\\n\\n## Root Cause\\n\\nMultiple locations check `hooks.internal.enabled` with falsy comparison (`!x` or `=== true`). When the user has not explicitly set `hooks.internal.enabled` in their config, the value is `undefined`, which fails all these checks.\\n\\nAffected locations:\\n- `src/hooks/loader.ts:69` - `if (!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` -- skips all hook loading\\n- `src/gateway/server-startup.ts:167` - `if (params.cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` -- skips startup hook init\\n- `src/plugins/registry.ts:378` - `=== true` -- skips hook system registration\\n- `src/security/audit-extra.sync.ts:531` - `=== true` -- audit reports hooks as disabled\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nChanged all four locations from truthy/strict-true checks to `!== false`. This makes internal hooks enabled by default, only disabled when the user explicitly sets `hooks.internal.enabled: false`.\\n\\nChanges: 4 files, 5 lines changed.\\n\\n## Testing\\n\\n- `openclaw hooks check` continues to work (no behavioral change)\\n- Bundled hooks now load by default without requiring explicit config\\n- Users can still disable with `hooks.internal.enabled: false`\\n\\nFixes #55929\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"color\":\"d4c5f9\",\"description\":\"Gateway runtime\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACV-EDaQ\",\"name\":\"gateway\"},{\"color\":\"b76e79\",\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACX2Cv9Q\",\"name\":\"size: XS\"}],\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default when not explicitly disabled\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/56250\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774682194079}}
{"type":"message","id":"ec8c7136","parentId":"336b5975","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:16:42.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"#56250 fixes #55929 which I have in my tracking as P34. It's about session-memory hook not loading because hooks.internal.enabled defaults to undefined. This is a great fix - very small (5 lines, 4 files), clear bug fix, and directly affects our memory system.Let me now support these three PRs:\n1. #56244 - Feishu duplicate tool registration fix (references #56114)\n2. #56204 - restore getApiKey callback after streamFn override (references #55816)\n3. #56250 - enable internal hooks by default (references #55929)\n\nThese are all small, clear bug fixes with no maintainer review. Let me add comments to all three.","thinkingSignature":"0bf97c626f418107f5fa645ed0ab1cc66254122778eb46ab5c86c534844dc5d4"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了三个最值得支持的 XS/S 小 PR，都是修复已知问题、无 maintainer review 的。顺手全支持了。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bucnywuhgo0s_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr comment 56244 --repo openclaw/openclaw --body \"This directly fixes #56114 — a hot-reload bug causing Feishu tools to re-register repeatedly, which we have tracked as a high-priority issue. The fix is minimal (1 file, 4 lines) with a clean module-level boolean guard. No behavioral side-effects for non-reloading configs. LGTM, requesting maintainer review.\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":40251,"output":282,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63158,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682194099,"responseId":"0616b35268724f24cb686429da38937f"}}
