{"type":"message","id":"8d3ba16b","parentId":"e55193c7","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:33:32.098Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0kf68zfli1kl_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"author\":\"manuel-claw\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":46299,\"title\":\"fix(whatsapp): drain reconnect queue after WhatsApp reconnects (#30806)\"}\n{\"author\":\"ignasicambra\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":47391,\"title\":\"fix(whatsapp): restore config-driven block streaming for WhatsApp delivery\"}\n{\"author\":\"dacrypt\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":55295,\"title\":\"feat(whatsapp): add allowOutboundTo config for separate outbound target authorization\"}\n{\"author\":\"AytuncYildizli\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":54038,\"title\":\"fix(whatsapp): pre-transcribe inbound voice notes before bootstrap\"}\n{\"author\":\"hassansys2\",\"labels\":[\"docs\",\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: L\"],\"number\":54183,\"title\":\"[AI] WhatsApp: add configurable send retry for transient network errors\"}\n{\"author\":\"joe2643\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"channel: feishu\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":55280,\"title\":\"fix(whatsapp): make block streaming configurable and fix delivery race in block-reply pipeline\"}\n{\"author\":\"joe2643\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":53369,\"title\":\"feat(whatsapp): support native @mentions in outbound group replies\"}\n{\"author\":\"javery556\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":49280,\"title\":\"fix(whatsapp): fall back when inbound from is missing\"}\n{\"author\":\"thiagorragazzo\",\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":50895,\"title\":\"whatsapp: normalize BR ninth-digit variants\"}\n{\"author\":\"Bluetegu\",\"labels\":[\"docs\",\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":55328,\"title\":\"fea