{"type":"message","id":"aecfa6cd","parentId":"8d3ba16b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:33:39.600Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There are many WhatsApp-related PRs but none that directly address the #56127 issue (WhatsApp plugin loads without being configured and crashes the agent). This is a specific regression in v2026.3.24 where the WhatsApp plugin's light-runtime-api is missing.\n\nLet me check if there's a PR that addresses this specific issue - the \"missing light-runtime-api\" problem.","thinkingSignature":"9e0dcddfae2b474def30f21052b6e533ec5017676d4408ee6c98c8bb6e81f9d0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_870uhduy5v2s_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --limit 20 --search \"light-runtime-api OR missing.*runtime OR runtime.*unavailable\" --json number,title,author,labels --jq '.[] | {number,title,author:.author.login}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":48283,"output":157,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683212099,"responseId":"0616b74c1b52c983673c2ed1753e58db"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cf6e0207","parentId":"aecfa6cd","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:33:40.348Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_870uhduy5v2s_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"author\":\"dafacto\",\"number\":38849,\"title\":\"fix(agents): clarify unavailable core tool warnings\"}\n{\"author\":\"jiejiesks\",\"number\":49089,\"title\":\"fix(acpx): read ACPX_PINNED_VERSION from package.json instead of hard…\"}\n{\"author\":\"tiagonix\",\"number\":56005,\"title\":\"feat(linux): implement native gateway client for the new Linux companion app (Issue #75)\"}\n{\"author\":\"vincent-peng\",\"number\":39564,\"title\":\"acp: improve backend-unavailable diagnostics in sessions_spawn\"}\n{\"author\":\"zhaoyang97\",\"number\":39995,\"title\":\"docs(web): mention web_fetch/browser fallback when web_search key missing\"}\n{\"author\":\"CyberWenShiFu\",\"number\":39489,\"title\":\"fix(feishu): report connection/event activity for health monitor\"}\n{\"author\":\"Alix-007\",\"number\":50256,\"title\":\"fix(daemon): avoid killing current gateway pid on restart\"}\n{\"author\":\"jlxyfll\",\"number\":56232,\"title\":\"fix(acpx): retain named sessions on queue owner unavailable\"}\n{\"author\":\"tower1229\",\"number\":54817,\"title\":\"Plugins: reload gateway-bindable runtimes when active registry is incompatible\"}\n{\"author\":\"AvalokiteshvaraBodhisattva\",\"number\":34357,\"title\":\"Android: systemd-backed gateway service path\"}\n{\"author\":\"wicky-AntX\",\"number\":50032,\"title\":\"Docs: initial draft delegation invariants (Confirm/Stop-Takeover/Receipts)\"}\n{\"author\":\"zephyn-z\",\"number\":53000,\"title\":\"fix(agents): clarify empty tool availability prompt\"}\n{\"author\":\"jmcte\",\"number\":45425,\"title\":\"fix(config): keep default memory slot from blocking updates\"}\n{\"author\":\"maesh3301\",\"number\":51523,\"title\":\"feat(matrix): add subagent hooks for ACP room-binding\"}\n{\"author\":\"justinjkline\",\"number\":