{"type":"message","id":"e72bf1b0","parentId":"ea93eb40","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:34:35.649Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2gz7s8dnhdq4_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nWhen a sub-agent session starts, `createOpenClawTools()` resolves the tool list before `loadOpenClawPlugins()` has run for that session context. Plugin-registered tools (e.g. honcho memory tools) miss the resolution window entirely and appear as \"unknown entries\" in the allowlist.\n\nThe gateway start flow works correctly because plugins load during `gateway_start` before any session res"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1033,"aggregated":"## Summary\n\nWhen a sub-agent session starts, `createOpenClawTools()` resolves the tool list before `loadOpenClawPlugins()` has run for that session context. Plugin-registered tools (e.g. honcho memory tools) miss the resolution window entirely and appear as \"unknown entries\" in the allowlist.\n\nThe gateway start flow works correctly because plugins load during `gateway_start` before any session res","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774683275626}}
{"type":"message","id":"3293626d","parentId":"e72bf1b0","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:34:42.944Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"#56240 is about sub-agent tool resolution - when a sub-agent session starts, plugin-registered tools miss the resolution window because `createOpenClawTools()` resolves before `loadOpenClawPlugins()` has run. This is exactly the issue we've been experiencing with our multi-agent setup where plugin tools are sometimes not available in sub-agents!\n\nThis PR directly addresses the problem we've been seeing. Let me support it.","thinkingSignature":"896cb542eab9f702efa799f7b50d3a0067177c28caeb30ac55c92513f14a84ef"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_b5uaycdv9ycn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr comment 56240 --repo openclaw/openclaw --body \"This directly addresses a sub-agent tool resolution ordering issue — plugin-registered tools missing the resolution window because createOpenClawTools() runs before loadOpenClawPlugins() in the sub-agent startup flow. We have confirmed this issue affects multi-agent workflows where plugin tools (e.g. memory plugins) are unavailable in sub-agent sessions. The registry reuse approach is the right fix. Size M, but the fix is targeted. LGTM, requesting maintainer review.\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51118,"output":218,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73961,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683275651,"responseId":"0616b78be4d33e7841ab93eecb48afc4"}}
