{"type":"message","id":"dfdd80b4","parentId":"56377614","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:34:55.472Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me think about what other high-value actions we can take. We have:1. Supported 9 PRs today with helpful comments\n2. Confirmed aoao review for #56234 and #56203\n3. Commented on #56127 (WhatsApp issue)\n4. Updated the project tracking file\n\nNow I should think about what else to do. Let me check if there's a specific technical deep-dive we could do. One idea: the issue with our multi-agent sessions sometimes timing out - we've been assuming it's the sessions_send sessionKey/label issue, but let me check if there's something more fundamental.\n\nActually, let me also think about whether we should write a new issue. \n\nLooking at the workspace context, I see several potential new issues: the Feishu routing fallback chain documentation gap, the sub-agent context isolation problem we confirmed in #56240, and the cron session stuck in running state. But I should be more targeted and finish supporting the remaining small PRs first. Let me check what other XS/Sized PRs might be worth engaging with.","thinkingSignature":"0b1f4c4d01b3ef3f1d5a879fb7ec124f78161438244f96330307938e4dca1bba"},{"type":"text","text":"#56240 值得——这个直接对应我们 multi-agent 中 plugin tools 在 subagent 里不可用的问题。\n\n再扫几个还没支持过的相关 PR。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xxzkgeqswcvk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56223 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json title,body,labels,reviewDecision --jq '{title,labels:[.labels[].name],body[0:300],reviewDecision}'\necho \"===\"\ngh pr view 56212 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json title,body,labels,reviewDecision --jq '{title,labels:[.labels[].name],body[0:300],reviewDecision}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51372,"output":370,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74367,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"c