{"type":"message","id":"52794818","parentId":"953d43f2","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:00.517Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to remove the [0:300] from the jq query. Let me just get the basic fields and then fetch the body separately.","thinkingSignature":"65f787e2294374a5b5efaf0fbdbbe620231893bf6c2e5aa0df42296c84ce9b3a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_15phyb7n3asz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56223 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json number,title,labels,reviewDecision --jq '{number,title,labels:[.labels[].name],reviewDecision}'\necho \"---\"\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56223 --jq '.body[0:300]'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51849,"output":117,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74591,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683296516,"responseId":"0616b7a0e2da85c7f4a78f45dfc9ac38"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a5c3a0b5","parentId":"52794818","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:02.113Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_15phyb7n3asz_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"labels\":[\"size: XS\"],\"number\":56223,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default\"}\n---\n## Summary\n\nFixes #55929\n\nInternal hooks (including `session-memory`) are not loaded on fresh installs because `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined`, and the loader checks `!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled` which is `true` for `undefined`.\n\nThis breaks `/new` and `/reset` session-memory savi"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1561,"aggregated":"{\"labels\":[\"size: XS\"],\"number\":56223,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default\"}\n---\n## Summary\n\nFixes #55929\n\nInternal hooks (including `session-memory`) are not loaded on fresh installs because `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined`, and the loader checks `!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled` which is `true` for `undefined`.\n\nThis breaks `/new` and `/reset` session-memory savi","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774683302095}}
{"type":"message","id":"d5c0b6cc","parentId":"a5c3a0b5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:07.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"#56223 is another PR fixing #55929 (same as #56250). This is interesting - two PRs (#56223 and #56250) both fixing the same issue! Let me check if they are from different authors. \n\nActually I already supported #56250. Let me see who authored #56223 and whether it's a better/worse fix.","thinkingSignature":"a8ae1d70ef567c9ac7bbc05072e78005cbbde0c9056a7fb0c3650b41b95a9b26"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_abz6dcw7hxd5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56223 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json number,title,author,labels,reviewDecision --jq '{number,title,author:.author.login,labels:[.labels[].name],reviewDecision}'\necho \"---\"\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56223 --jq '.body[0:500]'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":52079,"output":169,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74873,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683302115,"responseId":"0616b7a6bc074f740bfc3d3b85baeb0f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff79c69a","parentId":"d5c0b6cc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:08.672Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_abz6dcw7hxd5_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"author\":\"pgsev77\",\"labels\":[\"size: XS\"],\"number\":56223,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default\"}\n---\n## Summary\n\nFixes #55929\n\nInternal hooks (including `session-memory`) are not loaded on fresh installs because `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined`, and the loader checks `!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled` which is `true` for `undefined`.\n\nThis breaks `/new` and `/reset` session-memory saving.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **src/hooks/loader.ts**: Changed `if (!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` to `if (cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled === false)` — internal hooks are now enabled by default (opt-out)\n- **src/"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1159,"aggregated":"{\"author\":\"pgsev77\",\"labels\":[\"size: XS\"],\"number\":56223,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix: enable internal hooks by default\"}\n---\n## Summary\n\nFixes #55929\n\nInternal hooks (including `session-memory`) are not loaded on fresh installs because `hooks.internal.enabled` defaults to `undefined`, and the loader checks `!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled` which is `true` for `undefined`.\n\nThis breaks `/new` and `/reset` session-memory saving.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **src/hooks/loader.ts**: Changed `if (!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` to `if (cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled === false)` — internal hooks are now enabled by default (opt-out)\n- **src/","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774683308652}}
{"type":"message","id":"04b89857","parentId":"ff79c69a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:15.767Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"#56223 is from pgsev77 and addresses the same #55929 issue as #56250. Both are XS fixes. The approach in #56223 seems slightly different - it changes `if (!cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled)` to `if (cfg.hooks?.internal?.enabled === false)`, whereas #56250 changes all 4 locations.\n\nSince I already supported #56250, I should also support #56223 (same issue, different PR author) and note the duplication. Actually, let me also check #56223's CI status since it was created by pgsev77 who also created #56244 and #56250.\n\n\nThe maintainers will need to decide between these duplicate PRs, so I'll add my support to #56223 as well. Now moving on to #56212.","thinkingSignature":"0c4dc1798735f34dca13eac9a65b9fcae0841c75deb76d0a31f16eb19c73e7b8"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pmhe9ocvb6cx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 56212 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json number,title,author,labels,reviewDecision --jq '{number,title,author:.author.login,labels:[.labels[].name],reviewDecision}'\necho \"---\"\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56212 --jq '.body[0:400]'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":52421,"output":261,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75307,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683308673,"responseId":"0616b7ac3657d56617313ae7b9f10282"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2e64be41","parentId":"04b89857","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:35:17.278Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pmhe9ocvb6cx_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"author\":\"w-sss\",\"labels\":[\"app: web-ui\",\"cli\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":56212,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(cron): default to delivery mode 'none' when not explicitly set\"}\n---\nFixes #56078\n\n## Problem\nCron jobs created in the Web UI without explicit delivery configuration fail with:\n> Channel is required (no configured channels detected).\n\nThis happens even when the cron job's delivery mode is set to \"none\" or not configured at all.\n\n## Root Cause\nIn `src/cron/delivery.ts`, when `job.delivery.mode` is undefined or empty, the code defaults to `\"announce\"`:\n```typescript"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1476,"aggregated":"{\"author\":\"w-sss\",\"labels\":[\"app: web-ui\",\"cli\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":56212,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(cron): default to delivery mode 'none' when not explicitly set\"}\n---\nFixes #56078\n\n## Problem\nCron jobs created in the Web UI without explicit delivery configuration fail with:\n> Channel is required (no configured channels detected).\n\nThis happens even when the cron job's delivery mode is set to \"none\" or not configured at all.\n\n## Root Cause\nIn `src/cron/delivery.ts`, when `job.delivery.mode` is undefined or empty, the code defaults to `\"announce\"`:\n```typescript","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774683317260}}
