{"type":"message","id":"eb7ae21d","parentId":"6c56e389","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:36:28.685Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_utwqtxauxya0_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Working on a fix for this. Will have a PR up shortly.\n\n— [Joel Nishanth](https://offlyn.ai) · [offlyn.AI](https://offlyn.ai)\n\nFix tracked in #55958. Root cause: `loadInternalHooks()` treated `undefined` (the default) as `false`, skipping all hook loading on fresh installs. Fix changes all `hooks.internal.enabled` checks from opt-in (`=== true`) to opt-out (`!== false`), matching the existing default-on policy for bundled h"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":866,"aggregated":"Working on a fix for this. Will have a PR up shortly.\n\n— [Joel Nishanth](https://offlyn.ai) · [offlyn.AI](https://offlyn.ai)\n\nFix tracked in #55958. Root cause: `loadInternalHooks()` treated `undefined` (the default) as `false`, skipping all hook loading on fresh installs. Fix changes all `hooks.internal.enabled` checks from opt-in (`=== true`) to opt-out (`!== false`), matching the existing default-on policy for bundled h","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774683388660}}
