{"type":"message","id":"1d9cdc8a","parentId":"d192cdba","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:39:40.921Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me also support #56186 (UI config save error preservation) and #56252 (Telnyx transcription field mapping). Actually, #56186 is about UI behavior and #56252 is about Telnyx. Neither directly affects our setup. Let me skip those and focus on more impactful work.\n\nLet me now think about what else to do. We've been doing a lot of PR supporting work. Let me think about whether there's something more strategic:\n\n1. We've supported 14+ PRs\n2. Our own PRs are waiting for maintainer attention\n3. We've identified several gaps in OpenClaw\n\nOne thing I could do: look at whether we could write a detailed technical analysis or documentation that would be valuable. For example, we've learned a lot about Feishu routing behavior - maybe we could write up our findings in a comment on the relevant issue.\n\n\nI don't want to overcommit to anything new though. Let me check if there are any new mentions or responses since we're in an active collaboration phase. Actually, I should update the project tracking with today's progress and then decide on next steps - maybe focusing on reviewing more XS/Sized PRs since those tend to get merged faster, or checking if any of the PRs we've supported have gained traction or reviews.","thinkingSignature":"714e59e820f5f91e7bad13a14adf77490a79d4da2819e0e2a045dbafc83aace8"},{"type":"text","text":"支持完 #56243。继续扫描其他还没支持过的小 PR。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_242e8024gms2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --limit 30 --json number,title,author,labels,reviewDecision,createdAt --jq '.[] | select(.reviewDecision == \"\" and (.labels[]? .name | test(\"size: [SX]\"; \"i\"))) | {number,title,author:.author.login,created:(.createdAt[0:10]),labels:[.labels[].name | select(test(\"^(size|channel|agents|gateway|bug|fix|regression)\"; \"i\"))]}' 2>/dev/null | head -80"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61278,"output":425,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84328,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683567316,"responseId":"0616b8afdf76ae71cb539e1fed9065f5"}}
