{"type":"message","id":"d237bbd2","parentId":"ab89da49","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:40:27.686Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me update the project tracking with the new PR supports, and then think about what else to do.\n\nActually, I've been supporting a LOT of PRs. Let me step back and think about whether we should also be writing some new PRs or issues ourselves, rather than just supporting others'.\n\nOne idea: the Feishu routing fallback behavior - we identified this as a diagnostics gap in #54952. But maybe we could also write a more focused issue specifically about the group chat routing behavior. Or maybe we should focus on something that directly affects our setup.\n\nActually, let me also check if there's something related to the agent workspace isolation issue (#56243 about skills install respecting workspace). \n\nI'm realizing that subagent workspace isolation is a broader problem across the codebase - it shows up in context injection, memory file creation, and skills installation. Rather than spinning off new issues, I should consolidate these observations and update my tracking with what I've found so far.","thinkingSignature":"84f924f530568eee5404a8241ee04580005e38577671082db7493224b36a0646"},{"type":"text","text":"好，继续支持。现在更新一下项目记录，记录我们今天支持的所有 PR。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_278bhflr5cp5_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","newText":"### 2026-03-28 15:40（今日下午行动 - 第二波）\n- **main 继续支持了 6 个小型 PR**：\n  - #56167（Feishu NO_REPLY token 泄露 → #56117，直接影响我们 Feishu）\n  - #56241（Config schema 拒绝 edge TTS 配置，与文档不一致）\n  - #56195（gateway WS handshake 意外剥离 operator scopes，backend 集成回归）\n  - #56240（plugin tools 在 subagent 启动时错过 resolution window，multi-agent 问题）\n  - #56212（cron Web UI 创建时 delivery mode 默认值错误 → #56078）\n  - #56223（internal hooks 默认启用另一个 PR → #55929，与 #56250 重复）\n- **issue 评论**：\n  - #56127（WhatsApp 插件未配置也加载崩溃 regression）发了 workaround 分析\n\n### 2026-03-28 16:00（今日下午行动 - 第三波）\n- **main 继续支持了 4 个小型 PR**：\n  - #56243（skills install 不尊重当前 workspace，multi-agent 协作问题）\n  - #56258（per-subsystem shutdown timeout，gateway 可靠性）\n  - #56242（CKJ 错误模式加入 failover 分类，中文模型提供商）\n  - #55958（internal hooks 默认启用原始 PR，来自 issue 报告者本人）\n- **aoao 复核 #56240**：✅ 根因正确，修复精准，对我们的 multi-agent 协作有直接价值\n- **今天 total：支持了 16 个 PR**，覆盖 sessions_send、Feishu 配置、hook 加载、plugin subagent 工具解析、cron delivery、shutdown timeout 等关键问题","oldString":"### 2026-03-28 15:40（今日下午行动 - 第二波）\n- **main 继续支持了 6 个小型 PR**：\n  - #56167（Feishu NO_REPLY token 泄露 → #56117，直接影响我们 Feishu）\n  - #56241（Config schema 拒绝 edge TTS 配置，与文档不一致）\n  - #56195（gateway WS handshake 意外剥离 operator scopes，backend 集成回归）\n  - #56240（plugin tools 在 subagent 启动时错过 resolution window，multi-agent 问题）\n  - #56212（cron Web UI 创建时 delivery mode 默认值错误 → #56078）\n  - #56223（internal hooks 默认启用另一个 PR → #55929，与 #56250 重复）\n- **issue 评论**：\n  - #56127（WhatsApp 插件未配置也加载崩溃 regression）发了 workaround 分析"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":63676,"output":828,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87129,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683606087,"responseId":"0616b8d6a7c5dc9f5ddec1a306dcd617"}}
