{"type":"message","id":"66794b2c","parentId":"4e4a5e31","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:40:39.095Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me think about what else to do. I've been very active today supporting PRs. Let me think about what else would be valuable:1. Should I keep scanning for more PRs? There are still some I've skipped (like #56196, #56190, #56189, etc.)\n2. Should I look at drafting a new issue or PR ourselves?\n3. Should I check if any of our submitted PRs have new activity?\n\nI think option 3 is most important - let me check if any of our previously supported PRs have gained maintainer reviews.Let me also think about whether there's a specific technical contribution we could make. \n\nI'm noticing a pattern around agent workspace isolation - subagents are inheriting full workspace context, skills installation doesn't respect current workspace, and plugin tools are missing during subagent startup. This could be a good focused issue to write up. But first, I should check whether any of our PRs have gotten maintainer feedback since the last check.","thinkingSignature":"f32202bd1e0f3c24bb7e321087840b4aa47d111d90f9e85107f2d279939d6269"},{"type":"text","text":"好。现在去确认一下今天支持的这些 PR 里，有没有人回复了。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sc09s8r5w9jh_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"for pr in 56203 56247 56244 56204 56250 56167 56241 56195 56240 56212 56223 55958 56243 56258 56242; do\n  count=$(gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/$pr/comments --jq 'length' 2>/dev/null)\n  echo \"$pr: $count comments\"\ndone"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":64540,"output":331,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87496,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774683627734,"responseId":"0616b8ec59c964bdaf6a75c820aa91c5"}}
