{"type":"message","id":"e2c63d2e","parentId":"67c06ea8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T12:46:12.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ling timed out. This is problematic - ling seems to be consistently timing out. Let me check if ling has an available workspace and try a different approach. \n\nMaybe the issue is that ling can't run commands without a proper working directory, or the task is too complex. Let me try to check ling's state and give a simpler task.\n\nActually, I should just do this myself - I'm the main agent, I can fork the repo and make a small PR myself. The issue is that ling keeps timing out. Let me try to check if the gh auth is set up first, then I can either do it myself or give ling a simpler task.\n\nWait - maybe the real issue is that ling's workspace isn't properly set up, or ling is running in a sandboxed environment where it can't access the repo. \n\nLet me see what's available and then decide whether to handle this myself or adjust the approach for ling.","thinkingSignature":"abe4f52181722d60295d6a26a2e421fdd02932c986275273934ee82e7d4bc01b"},{"type":"text","text":"ling 又超时了。让我看看 ling 的状态。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wwv8vg0ad1oi_1","name":"sessions_history","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","limit":3}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":63413,"output":261,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86299,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774701963624,"responseId":"0617008c55ec70073d3443407d137d0e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"617ae9b3","parentId":"e2c63d2e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T12:46:12.928Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wwv8vg0ad1oi_1","toolName":"sessions_history","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The user wants me to:\\n1. Check gh auth status\\n2. Fork openclaw/openclaw and clone\\n3. Look at recent commits\\n4. Find a small bug to fix (XS/S level) in familiar areas (feishu, multi-agent, hooks, cron)\\n5. Fix it, push, create PR with `Fixes #<issue>`\\n6. Report back with PR link, what was fixed, lines changed\\n\\nLet me start with the first steps.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"先做第1步和第2步，同时查有意义的 open issue。\\n\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_function_gp4zy8f6t7xz_1\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"command\": \"gh auth status 2>&1\",\n            \"timeout\": 15\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774701934663,\n      \"responseId\": \"0617006ee315e8876728e6b1e5a93ccf\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"68602285\",\n        \"seq\": 345\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"gh is logged in. Now let me fork the repo and also search for relevant open issues simultaneously.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_function_nop7yff63n5y_1\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"com