{"type":"message","id":"ec40643a","parentId":"1ecfc8bc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:04:15.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So `sessionKeyForInternalHooks: ctxPayload.SessionKey`. The session key is being passed. Now the question is: what happens when the hook fires? Let me look at `emitMessageSentHooks` more carefully.\n\n```typescript\nfunction emitMessageSentHooks(\n  params: EmitMessageSentHookParams & {\n    hookRunner: ReturnType<typeof getGlobalHookRunner>;\n    enabled: boolean;\n  },\n): void {\n  if (!params.enabled && !params.sessionKeyForInternalHooks) {\n    return;  // Early return\n  }\n  const canonical = buildTelegramSentHookContext(params);\n\n\n```\n\nThe function fires the hook if enabled, but there's an early return that might be preventing execution in certain cases. Let me check the logic: if `enabled` is false AND there's no `sessionKeyForInternalHooks`, it returns early. The `enabled` flag depends on `hasMessageSentHooks`, which checks if the hook runner actually has registered hooks. If no hooks are registered, `enabled` would be false, but the condition also requires `sessionKeyForInternalHooks` to be falsy for the early return to trigger.\n\nLooking at the actual issue—plugin-registered `message_sent` hooks aren't firing—it's likely either the hook runner isn't picking up the plugin hooks, or the hook is registered but the event isn't being triggered. I should trace through the hook registration to see if plugins are properly adding their hooks to the runner.\n\nActually, this is getting tangled. I need to focus on finding a specific, fixable bug rather than continuing to debug the hook system itself. Let me look for a more concrete issue to work on.\n\nI'm going to switch gears and check if there are any test failures or simpler problems in the codebase I can tackle. Let me explore whether the Feishu NO_REPLY issue has already been addressed by the existing PR.","thinkingSignature":"773055906676a3404700c8f3d5efac15c3115b4fa5a799f3755a4ae7229e52d1"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mx8mj0r93wkn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -rn \"NO_REPLY\\|isSilentReplyText\" /root/openclaw-fork/extensions/feishu/src/outbound.ts 2>/dev/null | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":82915,"output":443,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105983,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703043185,"responseId":"061704c372ebc5bb6e6de7229346e2db"}}
