{"type":"message","id":"9df6d797","parentId":"06dabc43","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:07:54.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Line 143 is in `FeishuGroupSchema` (before `.strict()` at line 153), and it's defined as `z.boolean().optional()`. So the schema should accept `requireMention: false` in group config without issues.\n\nLet me think differently. Maybe the issue is not in the schema but in the runtime code. Let me look at the test for the policy.","thinkingSignature":"d1fc13c2d033da356bb6ded00ecf5d5d56f95ecfcd08449cdee9af5fee3b35bc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_b3prn03o66e6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"requireMention\" /root/openclaw-fork/extensions/feishu/src/policy.test.ts | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":62891,"output":132,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703269852,"responseId":"061705a6e239289680ff5fc5fda64d34"}}
{"type":"message","id":"35f506f2","parentId":"9df6d797","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:07:54.408Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_b3prn03o66e6_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"33:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: false });\n40:        cfg: createCfg({ groupPolicy: \"open\", requireMention: true }),\n44:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n53:          requireMention: false,\n57:              requireMention: true,\n65:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n74:          groups: { oc_1: { requireMention: true } },\n79:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n90:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n98:        \"*\": { requireMention: false },\n99:        \"oc-explicit\": { requireMention: true },\n108:    expect(resolved).toEqual({ requireMention: false });\n114:        \"*\": { requireMention: false },\n115:        \"oc-explicit\": { requireMention: true },\n124:    expect(resolved).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n130:        \"*\": { requireMention: false },\n131:        OC_UPPER: { requireMention: true },\n140:    expect(resolved).toEqual({ requireMention: true });"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":13,"aggregated":"33:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: false });\n40:        cfg: createCfg({ groupPolicy: \"open\", requireMention: true }),\n44:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n53:          requireMention: false,\n57:              requireMention: true,\n65:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n74:          groups: { oc_1: { requireMention: true } },\n79:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n90:    ).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n98:        \"*\": { requireMention: false },\n99:        \"oc-explicit\": { requireMention: true },\n108:    expect(resolved).toEqual({ requireMention: false });\n114:        \"*\": { requireMention: false },\n115:        \"oc-explicit\": { requireMention: true },\n124:    expect(resolved).toEqual({ requireMention: true });\n130:        \"