{"type":"message","id":"2352ae2e","parentId":"a1d38063","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:09:41.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`isGroup = ctx.chatType === \"group\"`. So if Feishu sends `chatType: \"group\"` for the reporter's group, it should be treated as a group.\n\nBut wait - could the reporter be in a different type of group? What if the Feishu \"group\" they're in has a different `chatType`? Some group messages might be classified as `p2p` (direct message) even in a group context.\n\nActually, I think I'm over-analyzing this. Let me just find a straightforward bug to fix and write the PR. Let me look at the Feishu issue #56197 about 401 token refresh - this is clearer in terms of what needs to be fixed.\n \nActually, the token refresh issue spans multiple layers - it involves the embedded agent, HTTP client, and provider - so that's too complex. Let me go back to the requireMention bug with the test case from the policy test file and write a test that reproduces the reported behavior, then work backward from there to find where the logic breaks down.\n\nBut wait - I should check if there's already a PR for this bug. The Feishu community might have already identified and fixed it.","thinkingSignature":"cd4fe14a7d627ebe3fb5ba541893eff97c1440f1bbbaa5157d5f9ab416ac8c28"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1j5ck39gehrr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --search \"requireMention\" --state open --json number,title,labels --jq '.[] | {number,title,labels:[.labels[].name]}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":68417,"output":312,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703371922,"responseId":"0617060c5015610c3b021ce9f4ac729c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cbc3da47","parentId":"2352ae2e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:09:42.560Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1j5ck39gehrr_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"labels\":[\"channel: telegram\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":49980,\"title\":\"fix(telegram): prioritize topic-level requireMention over activation override\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: discord\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":56400,\"title\":\"fix(discord): configuredBinding should not bypass requireMention in guild channels\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":40790,\"title\":\"fix(feishu): add requireMention policy debug log for troubleshooting #40766\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: slack\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":38658,\"title\":\"fix(slack): retain channel history when requireMention is false\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: telegram\",\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":27505,\"title\":\"feat(groups): add requireMention: \\\"monitor\\\" for passive group monitoring\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: discord\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":51531,\"title\":\"fix(discord): preserve requireMention for ACP thread sessions\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: telegram\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":34236,\"title\":\"Telegram: honor text_mention in requireMention gating\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":42007,\"title\":\"feat(feishu): add mentionTriggers support for text-based keyword triggers in groups\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"size: S\"],\"number\":49962,\"title\":\"fix: groupPolicy 'open' should not be overridden by explicit group entries\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":50394,\"title\":\"fix(feishu): stop treating @all as a direct bot mention in group chats\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":40530,\"title\":\"feat(feishu): add requireMentionInThread to allow thread replies without @mention\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":56384,\"title\":\"fix(feishu): normalize group ID prefix in requireMention config (#56338)\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: slack\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":33519,\"title\":\"fix(slack): thread sessions respect timeout (history + implicit mention)\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: slack\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":41811,\"title\":\"feat(slack): add thread.autoReplyOnParticipation config option\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: S\"],\"number\":53190,\"title\":\"feat(whatsapp): add requireMention \\\"monitor\\\" mode for passive group logging\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: discord\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":34879,\"title\":\"fix(discord): requireMention regression — guild messages misclassified as DMs\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":36172,\"title\":\"feat: WhatsApp community sub-group monitor support\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: discord\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":45345,\"title\":\"fix(discord): honor raw mention tokens in preflight\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: slack\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":53161,\"title\":\"fix(slack): bypass mention gate for app_mention events\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: slack\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":50874,\"title\":\"feat(slack): add requireMentionInThreads config to disable implicit thread mentions\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"docs\",\"size: XL\"],\"number\":54099,\"title\":\"feat(synology-chat): add group/channel support\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"docs\",\"channel: slack\",\"gateway\",\"scripts\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":55741,\"title\":\"feat(slack): add thread-aware requireMentionInThreads config (#30270)\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: discord\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":55302,\"title\":\"feat(discord): REST API catch-up for missed messages after reconnect\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: feishu\",\"size: XS\"],\"number\":49770,\"title\":\"fix(feishu): stop @_all from triggering all bots in group chat\"}\n{\"labels\":[\"channel: whatsapp-web\",\"agents\",\"size: M\"],\"number\":48570,\"title\":\"feat(whatsapp): add poll, reaction, event, and RSVP message support\