{"type":"message","id":"279c0abc","parentId":"5440cf43","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:16:57.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both are 0 but gh said comment_count:2 earlier. That's ok - it might be counting reactions or something else. Let me look at what other channels might have the same NO_REPLY issue that Talegqz fixed for Feishu. The issue #56117 was specifically about Feishu, but the same pattern might exist in other channels.\n\nActually, looking at what Talegqz fixed - adding `isSilentReplyText` guard in Feishu's `sendText` and `sendMedia` before making the API call - this is specific to Feishu. Other channels may or may not have the same issue.\n\nLet me instead look at whether there are any other small improvements I can make. Let me check what other XS/S PRs are still open that I haven't reviewed yet.","thinkingSignature":"bd256d48a83198f6df45183683678ac46d957966c83bf95001bc612de0598946"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bnzc401l47es_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr list --repo openclaw/openclaw --state open --limit 20 --search \"no:reviews size:XS\" --json number,title,author,labels --jq '.[] | {number,title,author:.author.login}' 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78580,"output":240,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101445,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703808833,"responseId":"061707c07ca38231e38693ca836194cc"}}
