{"type":"message","id":"989a8832","parentId":"b7c02823","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:19:49.384Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No TODO/FIXME comments in the Feishu plugin code. Let me look for a different approach. Let me look at the tests in the Feishu plugin to see if there are any skipped tests that might give hints about bugs.Actually, let me think about what I know about the Feishu plugin and what could be improved:\n\n1. The NO_REPLY token suppression - already fixed by Talegqz in #56167\n2. The requireMention group ID normalization - already fixed by w-sss in #56384\n3. The Feishu tool hot reload duplicate registration - already fixed by pgsev77 in #56244What else is there? Looking at the issue list:\n\n\n- #56197: Feishu embedded agent returns HTTP 401 instead of refreshing token\n- #56127: WhatsApp plugin loads even when not configured (not Feishu)\n\nThe #56197 issue with the 401 token refresh seems like the most actionable one to tackle. Let me examine how the embedded agent handles token refresh to see where the fix should go.","thinkingSignature":"4725c5882da940db084604c9c26656546e1b8cebcb61e4b7767a59a713d92461"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nmm0phx7fxfj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -rn \"401\\|Invalid token\\|token.*refresh\\|refresh.*token\" /root/openclaw-fork/extensions/feishu/src/*.ts 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"test\" | head -15"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78847,"output":292,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101764,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774703977266,"responseId":"06170869678d17783909673c1e43df2c"}}
