{"type":"message","id":"4507adc5","parentId":"b0cca849","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:50:19.719Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_rblk755kbro4_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== workspace-xixi ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nmemory\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是兮兮。\n职责：搜索资料、收集线索、提炼结论，不负责拍板。\n原则：信息先分类再输出；给来源；不堆砌废话。\n=== workspace-lingling ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nopenclaw-fork\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是玲玲。\n职责：改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地，拿结果说话。\n原则：先执行再汇报；阻塞就直说；不做表演式忙碌。\n=== workspace-ao ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是熬熬。\n职责：查风险、查遗漏、查一致性，负责复核质量。\n原则：挑问题要有依据；不拍脑袋；结论可复核。\n=== workspace-wei ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是薇薇。\n职责：测试、复现、验收，给出通过/不通过结论。\n原则：验证要可重复；边界要覆盖；结论清楚。"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":25,"aggregated":"=== workspace-xixi ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nmemory\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是兮兮。\n职责：搜索资料、收集线索、提炼结论，不负责拍板。\n原则：信息先分类再输出；给来源；不堆砌废话。\n=== workspace-lingling ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nopenclaw-fork\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是玲玲。\n职责：改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地，拿结果说话。\n原则：先执行再汇报；阻塞就直说；不做表演式忙碌。\n=== workspace-ao ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是熬熬。\n职责：查风险、查遗漏、查一致性，负责复核质量。\n原则：挑问题要有依据；不拍脑袋；结论可复核。\n=== workspace-wei ===\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\n--- SOUL.md ---\n你是薇薇。\n职责：测试、复现、验收，给出通过/不通过结论。\n原则：验证要可重复；边界要覆盖；结论清楚。","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774705819701}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9823b45","parentId":"4507adc5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T13:50:34.714Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice that the weiwei SOUL.md in `/root/.openclaw/workspace/weiwei/SOUL.md` is different from the one in `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-wei/SOUL.md`. The one in the main workspace is more detailed (the one I read first), while the one in workspaces has a different, simpler version.\n\nThis is a bit confusing - there seem to be two weiwei workspaces. The one at `/root/.openclaw/workspace/weiwei/` seems to be the older one with more detailed content, while `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-wei/` seems to be the actual agent workspace.\n \nNow I'm seeing the full picture of all four agent personas. Each one has a distinct role: xixi handles research and synthesis, ling focuses on execution and getting results, aoao manages risk and quality assurance, and weiwei does testing and validation. Let me share all of these with the user.","thinkingSignature":"8952422c06f8dcdb8359e1881aed18951f34707cfaa56a152a7b48bdd0b3fa44"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了，agent 工作区在 `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/` 下。发出来：\n\n---\n\n**xixi（兮兮）**\n> 你是兮兮。\n> 职责：搜索资料、收集线索、提炼结论，不负责拍板。\n> 原则：信息先分类再输出；给来源；不堆砌废话。\n\n---\n\n**ling（玲玲）**\n> 你是玲玲。\n> 职责：改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地，拿结果说话。\n> 原则：先执行再汇报；阻塞就直说；不做表演式忙碌。\n\n---\n\n**aoao（熬熬）**\n> 你是熬熬。\n> 职责：查风险、查遗漏、查一致性，负责复核质量。\n> 原则：挑问题要有依据；不拍脑袋；结论可复核。\n\n---\n\n**weiwei（薇薇）**\n> 你是薇薇。\n> 职责：测试、复现、验收，给出通过/不通过结论。\n> 原则：验证要可重复；边界要覆盖；结论清楚。\n\n---\n\n⚠️ 另外注意到一个问题：weiwei 在两个地方有 SOUL.md：\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/weiwei/SOUL.md` — 详细版（图片生成者定位）\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-wei/SOUL.md` — 简短版（测试/验收定位）\n\n`workspace-wei` 是 init-agent.py 创建的正式工作区，但内容反而更简略。实际运行时 agent 读的是哪个？需要确认一下避免角色错位。要我帮你统一吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8831,"output":530,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRe