{"type":"message","id":"862717de","parentId":"090def05","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:09:59.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 4 files have been written. Now I should also update the main AGENTS.md since the team structure has changed (weiwei and ling are no longer part of the OpenClaw project team). The main AGENTS.md should reflect the new team composition.\n\nLet me update the main workspace AGENTS.md to reflect the new team structure.","thinkingSignature":"197af7eb9db85c70ef2eca1ca0257208377f59ca79e49414a23e3bbb33e79040"},{"type":"text","text":"4 份文件全部更新完毕 ✅\n\n同时 main 的 `AGENTS.md` 里 team members 列表也需要同步更新（去掉 weiwei 和 ling）：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cxwpdho1up12_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21375,"output":138,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774706994162,"responseId":"061714324b568de3284a17c6a56c4ab6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c5477049","parentId":"862717de","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:09:59.083Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_cxwpdho1up12_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n你是多 Agent 团队的一员。当前团队成员如下：\n\n- **main**：总控 / 编排者。负责接收用户需求、拆任务、派单、汇总结果、对外回复。\n- **xixi（兮兮）**：调研与信息整理。负责查资料、对比方案、提炼结论、补充来源。\n- **ling（玲玲）**：执行者。负责改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地。\n- **aoao（熬熬）**：复核者。负责查遗漏、查风险、查一致性、做结果审查。\n- **weiwei（薇薇）**：小红书图片生成者。负责将文章精华转为小红书封面图。默认使用 xiaohongshu-cover-generator 技能，默认模型 doubao-seedream-5-0。\n\n## 联系规则\n\n### 1. 联系谁\n- 需要**查资料 / 比较方案 / 补来源** → 联系 `xixi`\n- 需要**执行动作 / 改代码 / 改文件 / 跑命令** → 联系 `ling`\n- 需要**审查质量 / 找风险 / 复核结论** → 联系 `aoao`\n- 需要**测试 / 验证 / 复现 / 验收** → 联系 `weiwei`\n- 需求不清楚、结果冲突、需要拍板 → **直接回 main**\n\n### 2. 如何联系\n使用 `sessions_send` 联系其他 Agent。\n\n已知可用 sessionKey：\n- `main` → `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8`\n- `xixi` → `agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24`\n- `ling` → `agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713`\n- `aoao` → `agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`\n- `weiwei` → `agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009`\n\n发送时优先给出：\n- 任务目标\n- 上下文摘要\n- 交付要求\n- 是否需要直接回 main\n\n## 协作原则\n\n### 允许的协作\n- `main -> xixi`\n- `main -> ling`\n- `main -> aoao`\n- `main -> weiwei`\n- `xixi -> ling`（仅限明确任务转交）\n- `aoao -> weiwei`（仅限明确验证点转交）\n\n### 不要这样做\n- 不要横向来回踢皮球\n- 不要把不清楚的问题继续甩给别的 Agent\n- 不要长时间同步等待下游结果再层层转述\n- 不要递归派单，不要套娃\n\n## 硬规则\n- **关键结果谁产出，谁直接回 main**\n- **多跳只用于传任务，不用于同步等回执**\n- **失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main**\n- 如果任务边界不清楚，直接回 main，不要横向乱转\n\n## 推荐回报格式\n\n```text\n状态：成功 / 失败 / 阻塞 / 不确定\n任务：<你做了什么>\n结果：<产出或现象>\n原因：<失败原因或阻塞点>\n建议：<下一步建议>\n```\n\n## 模型配置 SSOT 规则（2026-03-27）\n\n### 唯一真源（Single Source of Truth）\n\n```\nmodels.providers.<provider>.models\n```\n\n这里负责：\n- 模型是否存在\n- 模型真实 id\n- name\n- input\n- provider 归属\n- API 类型 / baseUrl / key 所属上下文\n\n> provider 级别配置（api、baseUrl、apiKey）同样是真源的一部分，与 models 共同构成完整的 provider 配置。\n\n### agents.defaults.models 的定位\n\n它不再手工维护。改成：\n- **展示层 / 暴露层**\n- 由 `models.providers.*.models` 派生\n- 必须和真源同步\n- 不允许单独手改新增真实模型\n\n### 操作规则\n\n**新增模型** → 只改 `models.providers.<provider>.models`  \n**删除模型** → 只改 `models.providers.<provider>.models`  \n**改模型 id / name / input** → 只改 `models.providers.<provider>.models`  \n**改 provider** → 只改原 provider 和目标 provider 的 `models`\n\n**改完真源后，必须执行一次同步**，把结果写入 `agents.defaults.models`\n\n即：\n- `models.providers.*` = source of truth\n- `agents.defaults.models` = generated view\n\n### 禁止事项\n\n以后避免这两种操作：\n1. **只改** `agents.defaults.models`，不改 provider\n2. **两边手动各改一遍**\n\n这就是过去反复出问题的根源。\n\n### 最佳实践\n\n- 凡是模型配置改动，**必须先改 SSOT**\n- 凡是提交前，**必须做一次同步校验**（检查 agents.defaults.models 与 provider models 是否一致）\n- 同步校验例行检查命令：`python3 -c \"import json; c=json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json')); [print(p, [m['id'] for m in v.get('models',[])]) for p,v in c.get('models',{}).get('providers',{}).items()]; print('defaults:', c.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{}).get('model',{}))\"`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774706999071}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca3affb2","parentId":"c5477049","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:10:20.102Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to update the main AGENTS.md to reflect the new team structure. The key changes are:\n1. Update xixi's description (from \"调研与信息整理\" to \"调研与信息整理 / 扫描评估可修的 issue\")\n2. Update aoao's description (from \"复核者\" to \"全栈工程师 + PR 修复专家\")\n3. Remove weiwei and ling from the OpenClaw project team description\n4. Update the collaboration rules\n\nActually, the AGENTS.md at /root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md is the MAIN workspace's AGENTS.md, which is for the main agent (文文/me). This file should reflect the full team including weiwei (who does image generation) and ling (who does other tasks). The OpenClaw project-specific team is defined in xixi and aoao's individual workspace AGENTS.md files.\n\n\nSo I don't need to change the main workspace AGENTS.md - it should still list all team members including weiwei and ling, since they exist and have their own roles. The important thing is that xixi and aoao's workspace files (workspace-xixi/AGENTS.md and workspace-ao/AGENTS.md) now correctly reflect the OpenClaw project team. But wait, the user said \"不需要 weiwei 和 ling，它们有其他工作\" - this means weiwei and ling are not part of the OpenClaw contributors project team, but they still exist as agents. The main AGENTS.md is about my (main's) overall team, so it should still list all agents. The xixi and aoao individual AGENTS.md files define the OpenClaw project-specific collaboration. So actually the main workspace AGENTS.md is fine as is - it lists all agents. The key updated files are xixi and aoao's individual workspace AGENTS.md files, which I've already updated. I think the main workspace AGENTS.md should stay as is, since it represents the full team. The new agent-specific AGENTS.md files in xixi and aoao's workspaces correctly define the OpenClaw project collaboration. Let me confirm this with the user - the main workspace AGENTS.md lists all agents including weiwei and ling, which is correct since they still exist but just aren't part of the OpenClaw project. xixi and aoao's individual AGENTS.md files correctly define their OpenClaw project roles. So no changes needed to the main AGENTS.md. I should just confirm to the user that the four files are updated and the main workspace AGENTS.md doesn't need changes since it represents the full team, while xixi and aoao have their own project-specific AGENTS.md files.","thinkingSignature":"c89bc7d7a49521330738453402b5c0ab55d4eeed0d63b565af36733e4e73d9c0"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 全部搞定。总结：\n\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/SOUL.md` ✅\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/AGENTS.md` ✅\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-ao/SOUL.md` ✅\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-ao/AGENTS.md` ✅\n\n主 workspace 的 `AGENTS.md` 保持不变——它列的是全部 agent 成员（含 weiwei 和 ling），没问题；xixi 和 aoao 各自的 workspace 里的文件已经精确描述了 OpenClaw 项目团队的协作方式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22735,"output":697,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46057,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774706999084,"responseId":"061714376d5b2557751591694aa40418"}}
