{"type":"message","id":"d5587f73","parentId":"a71e72bf","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:11:34.872Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. No separate MEMORY.md in aoao's workspace either. Let me also verify the main AGENTS.md - since xixi and aoao's roles have changed significantly, does the main AGENTS.md need updating to reflect the new team structure (without ling and weiwei in the OpenClaw project context)?Looking at the main AGENTS.md again:\n- It lists all team members (main, xixi, ling, aoao, weiwei)\n- This is the main workspace and lists all agents overall\n- The question is whether the \"OpenClaw 项目\" specific team (xixi + aoao + main) needs to be reflected differently in main's AGENTS.md\n\n\nThe main AGENTS.md is the master list across all projects, so that's fine as-is. The project-specific context lives in each agent's own AGENTS.md workspace. The SOUL.md and AGENTS.md files for xixi and aoao are already updated, MEMORY.md and OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md are synced, and there are no lingering references to the old structure that need fixing.\n\nThe OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md still has some historical references to ling, but those are actual events from the past so they should stay. I think everything's now consistent.","thinkingSignature":"c42c5b01bb49195ada1f5f55b3ae70025597e20d996fc5e27d1dcedf1d5cef19"},{"type":"text","text":"检查完毕，已完成以下更新：\n\n| 文件 | 更新内容 |\n|------|---------|\n| `MEMORY.md` | aoao 角色从\"风险审查\"更新为\"全栈工程师，写代码修 bug 提 PR\" |\n| `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` | 团队成员从 `main+xixi+aoao+ling` 更新为 `main+xixi+aoao` |\n| `workspace-xixi/SOUL.md` | ✅ 已是最新 |\n| `workspace-xixi/AGENTS.md` | ✅ 已是最新 |\n| `workspace-ao/SOUL.md` | ✅ 已是最新 |\n| `workspace-ao/AGENTS.md` | ✅ 已是最新 |\n\n`OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` 里还有几处历史记录提到 ling（比如\"ling 已推送修复 commit\"），这些是真实发生过的历史事件，不是团队结构描述，无需改动。文件级记忆一致性已收敛完毕。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":31076,"output":464,"cacheRead":22625,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTok