{"type":"message","id":"41e2dceb","parentId":"bf5ec8e5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:16:36.388Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both agents timed out. This is expected - the sessions are probably idle and these are persistent agent sessions. I should inform main that I've sent the messages but both agents are timing out, which likely means they're not currently active/responsive. Main (me) might need to check on their sessions or they might be in a sleep state.\n\nLet me report back to the user about the status.","thinkingSignature":"3bba59980ff667fda0176b023925143eb576a4cbbd327c8c3be2ad21dae7f68d"},{"type":"text","text":"两个 agent 都超时了——说明它们当前 session 不活跃。可能是空闲超时或被其他进程阻塞。\n\n**建议：** 单独唤醒它们。先确认一下 session 状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vcyulyfv5dum_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["subagent"],"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":31796,"output":156,"cacheRead":22635,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54587,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774707389200,"responseId":"061715bdd3eea5b955f7832b3ba9e3c6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8da05442","parentId":"41e2dceb","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:16:37.815Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vcyulyfv5dum_1","toolName":"sessions_list","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"count\": 31,\n  \"sessions\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"displayName\": \"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"webchat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774707359183,\n      \"sessionId\": \"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 99105,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1774681691698,\n      \"endedAt\": 1774681761731,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 70033,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"Now I have a clear picture of the PR. Let me analyze it:\\n\\n1. **Root cause analysis** - The PR correctly identifies the issue:\\n   - Sub-agent sessions call `resolveRuntimePluginRegistry()` with different options (no `onlyPluginIds`, `coreGatewayHandlers`, etc.)\\n   - This produces a different cache key\\n   - So `getCompatibleActivePluginRegistry()` returns undefined\\n   - Then it falls through to `loadOpenClawPlugins()` which runs too late (after `createOpenClawTools()`)\\n   - Result: plugin-registered tools appear as \\\"unknown entries\\\"\\n\\n2. **Fix correctness**:\\n   - The fix adds `isGatewayScopedLoad()` predicate to detect when a caller is NOT gateway-scoped (doesn't have gateway-specific fields)\\n   - When non-gateway-scoped and the compatible registry lookup fails, it falls back to `getActivePluginRegistry()` (the one set during gateway startup)\\n   - The active registry is a safe superset for non-gateway-scoped callers, so this should work correctly\\n\\n3. **Side effects**:\\n   - The fallback only triggers when the caller is NOT gateway-scoped, so gateway-scoped loads won't be affected\\n   - For non-gateway-scoped calls, it reuses the active registry set during gateway startup, which is safe and avoids the redundant load\\n   - The main risk is minimal, though theoretically a subagent could have a different workspace config with a mismatched plugin set, but this is an acceptable tradeoff given the alternative is complete failure to load plugins\\n\\n4. **Our practical value**: This directly resolves our multi-agent workflow issue where plugin tools (honcho memory, feishu, etc.) weren't available in sub-agents. The fix appears solid with targeted tests, no behavioral changes for existing gateway-scoped calls, and only a minimal side effect that's acceptable.\\n\\n5. **Conclusion**: Worth prioritizing for merge since it's a targeted, minimal fix that addresses the core issue, has good test coverage, and the side effect is a reasonable tradeoff.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"\\n\\n状态：完成\\n任务：复核 PR #56240 fix(plugins): reuse active registry for sub-agent tool resolution\\n\\n结果：\\n\\n**1. 根因分析：正确**\\n\\n- Sub-agent session 调用 `resolveRuntimePluginRegistry()` 时没有 gateway-specific 字段（`onlyPluginIds`、`coreGatewayHandlers` 等）\\n- 这导致 cache key 与 gateway 启动时设置的 active registry 不同\\n- `getCompatibleActivePluginRegistry()` 返回 undefined，fall through 到 `loadOpenClawPlugins()`\\n- 但 `createOpenClawTools()` 在 `loadOpenClawPlugins()` 之前运行，所以 plugin tools 错过了 resolution window\\n- Gateway 主流程没问题是因为 plugins 在 `gateway_start` 时已加载完毕，active registry 已经就位\\n\\n**2. 修复方案：完整，side-effect 可控**\\n\\n- `isGatewayScopedLoad()` 精确区分 gateway-scoped 和 non-gateway-scoped 调用者\\n- 当 non-gateway-scoped 且 compatible registry miss 时，复用 gateway 启动时设置的 active registry（是安全超集）\\n- 新增 2 个测试 case 分别覆盖 fallback 路径和非 fallback 路径，逻辑严密\\n\\nSide-effect 分析：\\n- 理论上存在微小风险：sub-agent 的 workspace config 可能与 gateway 不同（导致 active registry 里的 plugins 对该 sub-agent 不是完整超集）\\n- 但相比当前\\\"plugin tools 完全不可用\\\"，这个 trade-off 值得\\n- Gateway-scoped 调用完全不受影响（有 `isGatewayScopedLoad()` 保护）\\n\\n**3. 对我们的实际价值：高**\\n\\n- 我们 multi-agent 协作（main -> xixi/lings/aoao）中 plugin tools 在 subagent 中经常不可用\\n- 这个 PR 直接解决的就是这个场景\\n- 修复后 honcho memory tools、feishu tools 等在 sub-agent session 中应该可用\\n\\n建议：**值得催促 merge**\\n\\n理由：\\n1. 根因找得准，修复方案最小化\\n2. 测试覆盖到位，逻辑严密\\n3. 直接解决我们 multi-agent 协作的痛点\\n4. Side-effect 可控，不破坏现有 gateway-scoped 路径\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 83710,\n            \"output\": 859,\n            \"totalTokens\": 99964,\n            \"cacheRead\": 15395,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774683452963,\n          \"responseId\": \"0616b83d99e4f57dd093d6c9ee4ec9f3\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"feaab0d5\",\n            \"seq\": 148\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"displayName\": \"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"webchat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774707321375,\n      \"sessionId\": \"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniM