n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/11ca7913-d9c6-4b4b-9e9b-1fa94f85347e.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"xiaohongshu-canghe-top3-45-v3.png\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openclaw\",\n          \"model\": \"delivery-mirror\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 0,\n            \"output\": 0,\n            \"totalTokens\": 0,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774095188073,\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"39d46d68\",\n            \"seq\": 20\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773912253188,\n      \"sessionId\": \"afc144cf-0fe9-4f92-aedc-77264e43e750\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/afc144cf-0fe9-4f92-aedc-77264e43e750.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"skills-5p-5.png\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openclaw\",\n          \"model\": \"delivery-mirror\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 0,\n            \"output\": 0,\n            \"totalTokens\": 0,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774100714903,\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"633e4eb3\",\n            \"seq\": 7\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"displayName\": \"范\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n        \"accountId\": \"default\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773822531623,\n      \"sessionId\": \"5344f640-cc1c-4515-b6c5-c2b42f800de7\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 272000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 23388,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 1.1742175,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"default\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5344f640-cc1c-4515-b6c5-c2b42f800de7.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"count":31,"sessions":[{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774707359183,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":99105,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774681691698,"endedAt":1774681761731,"runtimeMs":70033,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of the PR. Let me analyze it:\n\n1. **Root cause analysis** - The PR correctly identifies the issue:\n   - Sub-agent sessions call `resolveRuntimePluginRegistry()` with different options (no `onlyPluginIds`, `coreGatewayHandlers`, etc.)\n   - This produces a different cache key\n   - So `getCompatibleActivePluginRegistry()` returns undefined\n   - Then it falls through to `loadOpenClawPlugins()` which runs too late (after `createOpenClawTools()`)\n   - Result: plugin-registered tools appear as \"unknown entries\"\n\n2. **Fix correctness**:\n   - The fix adds `isGatewayScopedLoad()` predicate to detect when a caller is NOT gateway-scoped (doesn't have gateway-specific fields)\n   - When non-gateway-scoped and the compatible registry lookup fails, it falls back to `getActivePluginRegistry()` (the one set during gateway startup)\n   - The active registry is a safe superset for non-gateway-scoped callers, so this should work correctly\n\n3. **Side effects**:\n   - The fallback only triggers when the caller is NOT gateway-scoped, so gateway-scoped loads won't be affected\n   - For non-gateway-scoped calls, it reuses the active registry set during gateway startup, which is safe and avoids the redundant load\n   - The main risk is minimal, though theoretically a subagent could have a different workspace config with a mismatched plugin set, but this is an acceptable tradeoff given the alternative is complete failure to load plugins\n\n4. **Our practical value**: This directly resolves our multi-agent workflow issue where plugin tools (honcho memory, feishu, etc.) weren't available in sub-agents. The fix appears solid with targeted tests, no behavioral changes for existing gateway-scoped calls, and only a minimal side effect that's acceptable.\n\n5. **Conclusion**: Worth prioritizing for merge since it's a targeted, minimal fix that addresses the core issue, has good test coverage, and the side effect is a reasonable tradeoff."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n状态：完成\n任务：复核 PR #56240 fix(plugins): reuse active registry for sub-agent tool resolution\n\n结果：\n\n**1. 根因分析：正确**\n\n- Sub-agent session 调用 `resolveRuntimePluginRegistry()` 时没有 gateway-specific 字段（`onlyPluginIds`、`coreGatewayHandlers` 等）\n- 这导致 cache key 与 gateway 启动时设置的 active registry 不同\n- `getCompatibleActivePluginRegistry()` 返回 undefined，fall through 到 `loadOpenClawPlugins()`\n- 但 `createOpenClawTools()` 在 `loadOpenClawPlugins()` 之前运行，所以 plugin tools 错过了 resolution window\n- Gateway 主流程没问题是因为 plugins 在 `gateway_start` 时已加载完毕，active registry 已经就位\n\n**2. 修复方案：完整，side-effect 可控**\n\n- `isGatewayScopedLoad()` 精确区分 gateway-scoped 和 non-gateway-scoped 调用者\n- 当 non-gateway-scoped 且 compatible registry miss 时，复用 gateway 启动时设置的 active registry（是安全超集）\n- 新增 2 个测试 case 分别覆盖 fallback 路径和非 fallback 路径，逻辑严密\n\nSide-effect 分析：\n- 理论上存在微小风险：sub-agent 的 workspace config 可能与 gateway 不同（导致 active registry 里的 plugins 对该 sub-agent 不是完整超集）\n- 但相比当前\"plugin tools 完全不可用\"，这个 trade-off 值得\n- Gateway-scoped 调用完全不受影响（有 `isGatewayScopedLoad()` 保护）\n\n**3. 对我们的实际价值：高**\n\n- 我们 multi-agent 协作（main -> xixi/lings/aoao）中 plugin tools 在 subagent 中经常不可用\n- 这个 PR 直接解决的就是这个场景\n- 修复后 honcho memory tools、feishu tools 等在 sub-agent session 中应该可用\n\n建议：**值得催促 merge**\n\n理由：\n1. 根因找得准，修复方案最小化\n2. 测试覆盖到位，逻辑严密\n3. 直接解决我们 multi-agent 协作的痛点\n4. Side-effect 可控，不破坏现有 gateway-scoped 路径"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83710,"output":859,"totalTokens":99964,"cacheRead":15395,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774683452963,"responseId":"0616b83d99e4f57dd093d6c9ee4ec9f3","__openclaw":{"id":"feaab0d5","seq":148}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774707321375,"sessionId":"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":116101,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774707321334,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774707309074,"sessionId":"097aee4d-219f-4268-bf48-cc76b07ec48c","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":53701,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774707309004,"childSessions":["agent:main:subagent:93c873bf-167e-43ef-8013-a616f9762715"],"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/097aee4d-219f-4268-bf48-cc76b07ec48c.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both agents timed out. This is expected - the sessions are probably idle and these are persistent agent sessions. I should inform main that I've sent the messages but both agents are timing out, which likely means they're not currently active/responsive. Main (me) might need to check on their sessions or they might be in a sleep state.\n\nLet me report back to the user about the status."},{"type":"text","text":"两个 agent 都超时了——说明它们当前 session 不活跃。可能是空闲超时或被其他进程阻塞。\n\n**建议：** 单独唤醒它们。先确认一下 session 状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vcyulyfv5dum_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["subagent"],"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":31796,"output":156,"totalTokens":54587,"cacheRead":22635,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"to