规则：\n- 有事：直接输出结论和建议动作，不写内部思考过程\n\n所以我现在应该直接输出汇报内容，不写内部思考过程。\n\n汇报内容：\n1. #55995（严重安全漏洞）：已有新进展，EronFan 已将该问题作为安全问题在 #56173 正式披露\n2. #55994（weixin release blocker）：已有新进展，EronFan 提供了详细的根因定位和修复建议\n\n我应该简洁地汇报这些新进展。🚨 **OpenClaw 贡献项目重要进展汇报（2026-03-28 16:18）**\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 **#55995（严重安全漏洞）- 有新进展**\n\n**EronFan**（2026-03-28 04:45 UTC）：\n- 该漏洞已作为安全问题在 **#56173** 正式披露\n- 关闭此 issue #55995，转向安全标签的报告\n\n**coygeek**（2026-03-28 05:02 UTC）：\n- 很高兴看到 #55995 的发现成功作为\"properly disclosed\"重复问题的上游 beta 测试\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 **#55994（weixin release blocker）- 有新进展**\n\n**EronFan**（2026-03-28 05:29 UTC）：\n- 在 **v2026.3.24** 中确认此 bug 仍然存在\n- 提供了详细的根因定位和修复建议：\n  - **根因**：commit `6dfd39c3`（Harden Telegram poll gating）在 `src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` line 767-769 增加了全局 guard，这个 guard 放在 `runMessageAction()` 入口处，而非 Telegram 专用路径内\n  - **问题**：会拦截所有通道的 send 请求，包括 weixin\n  - **修复建议**：将 poll 参数校验下放到 Telegram 专用 handler 内，而不是放在全局入口\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **其他 PR 状态（无变化）**\n\n- #54952（Diagnostics gap）：0 条评论，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- #54964（Session zombie）：0 条评论，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- #55008（message channel docs）：ling 已修复 review 问题，等待 merge\n- #55013（feishu routing docs）：ling 已修复 review 问题，等待 merge\n\n---\n\n**下一步**：我已将进展记录到 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`，继续监控其他 issue/PR 的反馈。"},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":63725,"output":577,"totalTokens":64302,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774687268363,"responseId":"021774687268838d5207c26d0a58eb5efce990a189f397ede44ed","__openclaw":{"id":"67caf5c2","seq":57}}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 社区机会扫描","updatedAt":1774705593760,"sessionId":"d6f8a605-cb68-4294-99f5-afdb3904754a","model":"glm-4.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":90535,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774705593743,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/sessions/d6f8a605-cb68-4294-99f5-afdb3904754a.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774703285850,"sessionId":"d4eebe0e-5303-4765-b81e-edd7e84dc316","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":69720,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1774703233739,"endedAt":1774703285601,"runtimeMs":51862,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d4eebe0e-5303-4765-b81e-edd7e84dc316.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see exactly what's happening from the logs:\n\n1. At 21:06:39 (13:06:39 UTC): \n   - `feishu[xixi]`: received message from `ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24` (which is xixi's open_id) in `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` (group)\n   - `feishu[xixi]`: \"message in group oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 did not mention bot\"\n   - So xixi was in the group but her message didn't mention the bot\n\n2. At 21:06:40 (13:06:40 UTC):\n   - `feishu[aoao]`: received message from `ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506` (which is aoao's open_id) in `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` (group)\n   - `feishu[aoao]`: \"message in group oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3 did not mention bot\"\n   - aoao was also in the group but her message didn't mention the bot\n\n3. At 21:07:11 (13:07:11 UTC):\n   - `feishu[default]`: received message from `ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` in `oc_32d3f80703ed7e935d30e1121b32bbc6` (p2p - THIS IS THE DM!)\n   - `feishu[default]`: \"Feishu[default] DM from ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8: 你在群里还是没回复我，我有@\n\n我\"\n\nSo the user sent a DM saying \"你在群里还是没回复我，我有@你了，你看看是什么问题\" - this is a DM to me, NOT a group message. The group message that the user thinks they sent with an @ was actually sent as a DM to me instead. The user is confused about where they sent the message.\n\nLooking at the binding configuration, the group `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` is actually bound to the `main` agent, not to a bot account that would respond when mentioned. So when the user @mentioned the bot in the group, it routed to `main` but the bot didn't respond - likely because there's no bot actually bound to handle those mentions in the group chat. The group message never reached me at all - it was just discarded as \"did not mention bot\". The user's DM to me IS reaching and IS getting dispatched to the main session (21:07:11), and I'm replying in the DM.\n\nSo the real issue is: the group message the user thinks they sent with @ me didn't actually mention the bot, OR it was sent but the bot's feishu account (default) isn't configured correctly to receive group messages with mentions.\n\nActually wait - the binding for the group has `accountId` not specified, which means it uses... let me check the binding config more carefully.\n\nLooking at the binding:\n```json\n{\n  \"agentId\": \"main\",\n  \"match\": {\n    \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n    \"peer\": {\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"id\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThere's no `accountId` in the match criteria. This means the default account (`default`) should be used. And `requireMention: true` means the bot requires an @ mention to respond.\n\nSo when the user sent a message in the group with @ me, the message was received by the default account but... the \"did not mention bot\" error suggests the bot didn't recognize the mention.\n\nActually, looking at the log lines again:\n- `feishu[xixi]`: received message in group... did not mention bot\n- `feishu[aoao]`: received message in group... did not mention bot\n\nThese show xixi and aoao bots received the message but didn't respond because the message didn't mention them. But the group is bound to `main`, not to xixi or aoao.\n\nWait - the chat_id `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` appears in xixi's and aoao's received messages too! How can the same group message be received by xixi and aoao accounts?\n\nActually, I think what's happening is that each bot account (xixi, aoao, ling, etc.) is running its own WebSocket connection to Feishu. When a message comes into the group, each bot individually evaluates whether it was mentioned. So xixi and aoao both saw the message, found they weren't mentioned, and stayed silent - but `main` should have been triggered since the group is bound to it. The user likely @mentioned the wrong bot or the mention didn't register properly, which is why no response came through.\n\nThe issue is probably that the bot's open_id wasn't correctly parsed from the @mention in the group message. The mention detection is failing because the bot's identity isn't being recognized when referenced that way. The simplest solution would be to disable `requireMention: false` so the bot responds to all group messages without needing to be @mentioned."},{"type":"text","text":"日志里找到了真正原因。21:06:39 的记录显示：\n\n- `feishu[xixi]` 在群里收到了你的消息 → **\"did not mention bot\"**（没认出被 @）\n- `feishu[aoao]` 同样 → **\"did not mention bot\"**\n- 21:07:11 你发的「你在群里还是没回复我」是 **DM 私聊**，不是群聊 → 正常收到了并 dispatch 到 main session\n\n**真正的问题**：群里 @我 的消息，Feishu WebSocket 收到了，但 OpenClaw 认为 \"did not mention bot\"——说明 @mention 检测逻辑失效了，或者飞书机器人 open_id 没有被正确解析。\n\n有两个可能：\n1. 飞书机器人 app 的 `requireMention` 检测依赖 mention 内容里的 bot open_id，和 OpenClaw 内部的 account 不匹配\n2. 群里实际上有多个 bot 账号（xixi/aoao/ling 都绑了群），mention 解析互相干扰\n\n**最稳的解法**：把 `requireMention` 改成 `false`，bot 不用被 @ 就能响应群里所有消息。需要重启 gateway，立即生效。要我执行吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"min